(756016, 82259, 13381, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea -- different from all the bus stops I''m seeing this time around. I wish the little kid and horse were a bit sharper -- I don''t mind the riders in the background being a bit out of focus, with depth of field and movement and so forth, but the kid in the front being blurred is a bit jarring.</td>', 'Very cool idea -- different from all the bus stops I''m seeing this time around. I wish the little kid and horse were a bit sharper -- I don''t mind the riders in the background being a bit out of focus, with depth of field and movement and so forth, but the kid in the front being blurred is a bit jarring.', '2004-06-09 01:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
