(756171, 81652, 3724, '<td valign="top">Like an eye!  A interesting gas burner beauty...   a circle shape and near abstract elements seen through the water would be a common view,  but this makes me look.   Apparent strong daylight mixed with the burner flame is a different take to this often used theme.  To me very good colour and composition.   Excellent work.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=369902" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">GAS BURNER COLLECTION</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-12 22:03:33.</i></td>', 'Like an eye!  A interesting gas burner beauty...   a circle shape and near abstract elements seen through the water would be a common view,  but this makes me look.   Apparent strong daylight mixed with the burner flame is a different take to this often used theme.  To me very good colour and composition.   Excellent work. GAS BURNER COLLECTION', '2004-06-09 02:21:47.000000', '2006-04-12 23:03:33.000000', 1),
