(756908, 82141, 18854, '<td valign="top">All I can say is Wow - perfect shot - the lack of color creates a mood of gloominess and rain to fit her expression.</td>', 'All I can say is Wow - perfect shot - the lack of color creates a mood of gloominess and rain to fit her expression.', '2004-06-09 12:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
