(757184, 82479, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great example of "waiting" (and patience, and futility, and boredom...)  Your black and white print is superb - crisp with great white, blacks and tonal range.   My only complaint is that I don''t think you need the "Clearance 7'' 10" text. (Got a paintbrush?)</td>', 'Great example of "waiting" (and patience, and futility, and boredom...)  Your black and white print is superb - crisp with great white, blacks and tonal range.   My only complaint is that I don''t think you need the "Clearance 7'' 10" text. (Got a paintbrush?)', '2004-06-09 14:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(757186, 81499, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice backlighting - blossom seems to have an inner glow. Background sky is a bit overpowering.  Foreground somwhat cluttered - reach in and remove the star-shape on the bottom right.</td>', 'Nice backlighting - blossom seems to have an inner glow. Background sky is a bit overpowering.  Foreground somwhat cluttered - reach in and remove the star-shape on the bottom right.', '2004-06-09 14:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(757190, 81573, 3032, '<td valign="top">Ping Pong, alle treinen richting Haarlem hebben drie kwartier vertraging! De NS zet geen bussen in, we bieden geen koffie aan, u krijgt geen geld terug, we vertellen niet waarom de trein te laat is en reken maar niet op geld terug. Kaartjes vanaf morgen 8% in prijs verhoogd. Nog een fijne dag verder.<br/>Jammer dat het bord overbelicht is en de overbelichte achtergrond zo dominant is.</td>', 'Ping Pong, alle treinen richting Haarlem hebben drie kwartier vertraging! De NS zet geen bussen in, we bieden geen koffie aan, u krijgt geen geld terug, we vertellen niet waarom de trein te laat is en reken maar niet op geld terug. Kaartjes vanaf morgen 8% in prijs verhoogd. Nog een fijne dag verder.Jammer dat het bord overbelicht is en de overbelichte achtergrond zo dominant is.', '2004-06-09 14:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(757191, 82331, 19608, '<td valign="top">So that''s what they mean by a "watched pot!"  Nice capture - I especially like the red in the heating coil.  Not sure the side wall does much for the image.</td>', 'So that''s what they mean by a "watched pot!"  Nice capture - I especially like the red in the heating coil.  Not sure the side wall does much for the image.', '2004-06-09 14:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(757195, 82466, 19608, '<td valign="top">Moody but effective.  The small amount of lens flare doen''t  detract from the overall "feel."</td>', 'Moody but effective.  The small amount of lens flare doen''t  detract from the overall "feel."', '2004-06-09 14:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(757197, 82405, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice and good.</td>', 'Nice and good.', '2004-06-09 14:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(757199, 81154, 19608, '<td valign="top">That''s exactly what they are saying!  Good couple - nice exposure on the critters - but the foreground at bottom is a bit hot.  Too bad you didn''t get the catchlight in the eye on bith animals.</td>', 'That''s exactly what they are saying!  Good couple - nice exposure on the critters - but the foreground at bottom is a bit hot.  Too bad you didn''t get the catchlight in the eye on bith animals.', '2004-06-09 14:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(757200, 81300, 19608, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Doggie is a bit soft.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Doggie is a bit soft.', '2004-06-09 14:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(757201, 81380, 6130, '<td valign="top">Great.</td>', 'Great.', '2004-06-09 14:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(757204, 82443, 19608, '<td valign="top">Print is well rendered - strong black and whites.  Compositionally - I don''t care for the triangle shape on the right side.</td>', 'Print is well rendered - strong black and whites.  Compositionally - I don''t care for the triangle shape on the right side.', '2004-06-09 14:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(757210, 82399, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great idea and wonderful expression on your model.  But - the sky is so bright - it demands too much attention.</td>', 'Great idea and wonderful expression on your model.  But - the sky is so bright - it demands too much attention.', '2004-06-09 14:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(757211, 82044, 19608, '<td valign="top">Or not.  Nice expression on the cat - your title becomes believable.  Good exposure - hard on very white fur.</td>', 'Or not.  Nice expression on the cat - your title becomes believable.  Good exposure - hard on very white fur.', '2004-06-09 14:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(757212, 82286, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The bright colors of the sails really pop with the muted colors of the water and mountain.  Exposure is spot on.</td>', 'Very nice.  The bright colors of the sails really pop with the muted colors of the water and mountain.  Exposure is spot on.', '2004-06-09 14:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(757214, 81140, 19608, '<td valign="top">You snapped at the perfect time.  Composition is nice - just enough of the landing board to be a great lead in.  Exposure is good - but the bald white sky doesn''t help a bit.  Waiting is subtle.</td>', 'You snapped at the perfect time.  Composition is nice - just enough of the landing board to be a great lead in.  Exposure is good - but the bald white sky doesn''t help a bit.  Waiting is subtle.', '2004-06-09 14:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(757217, 82238, 19608, '<td valign="top">What an expression.  Title could be "What the H#$# am I doing here?"  Great colors and composition.  Best of all - you captured a great pose, great expression, and just a hint of spectators to add interest.  The white round spot behind his head is a bit distracting.  Great submission - thanks for sharing.</td>', 'What an expression.  Title could be "What the H#$# am I doing here?"  Great colors and composition.  Best of all - you captured a great pose, great expression, and just a hint of spectators to add interest.  The white round spot behind his head is a bit distracting.  Great submission - thanks for sharing.', '2004-06-09 14:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(757218, 82380, 21362, '<td valign="top">A cool photo, but really not having anything to do with the challenge imo.</td>', 'A cool photo, but really not having anything to do with the challenge imo.', '2004-06-09 14:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(757219, 81669, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful - nice composition at just the right time of day.  Tail lights really tell the story.</td>', 'Wonderful - nice composition at just the right time of day.  Tail lights really tell the story.', '2004-06-09 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(757224, 81625, 19608, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous chess set!  I like your placement of the brown piece between the knight shapes.  The pieces closest to the lens are so OOF they really detract.  Exposure good.</td>', 'A gorgeous chess set!  I like your placement of the brown piece between the knight shapes.  The pieces closest to the lens are so OOF they really detract.  Exposure good.', '2004-06-09 14:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(757225, 82487, 20494, '<td valign="top">this image reminds me about my ex-girlfriend....can''t let a girl keep waiting for ya! :)</td>', 'this image reminds me about my ex-girlfriend....can''t let a girl keep waiting for ya! :)', '2004-06-09 14:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(757227, 82145, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Your capture of the blue eyes and red tongue add a lot of interest.  Compositionally, I''m not excited by the straight lines of the cement.  The crop is very tight and you''ve exaggerated it by the way-too-heavy border.  So - it looks crowded - needs more room.</td>', 'Very nice!  Your capture of the blue eyes and red tongue add a lot of interest.  Compositionally, I''m not excited by the straight lines of the cement.  The crop is very tight and you''ve exaggerated it by the way-too-heavy border.  So - it looks crowded - needs more room.', '2004-06-09 15:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(757230, 80967, 21440, '<td valign="top">WELL DONE!! EVEN THIS IS SPEEDED UP FOR AFRICA TIME.<br/> <br/>A GOOD CROP.I WANT TO SEE THE ORIGINAL AND THE DATE..HAHA</td>', 'WELL DONE!! EVEN THIS IS SPEEDED UP FOR AFRICA TIME. A GOOD CROP.I WANT TO SEE THE ORIGINAL AND THE DATE..HAHA', '2004-06-09 15:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(757231, 82045, 19608, '<td valign="top">Cute liitle dool.  May be a bit over exposed.  The bottles do nothing for you image and could easily be cropped out.  If you did that you also take away the "dead centered" look - a good thing.</td>', 'Cute liitle dool.  May be a bit over exposed.  The bottles do nothing for you image and could easily be cropped out.  If you did that you also take away the "dead centered" look - a good thing.', '2004-06-09 15:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(757234, 82141, 21362, '<td valign="top">Great portrait.</td>', 'Great portrait.', '2004-06-09 15:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(757238, 82360, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice juxtaposition.  Make it more effective by removing the railing at the bottom left.  Perfect exposure - even with that horrendous sky.  Too bad you don''t see a bit more of the red light.</td>', 'A very nice juxtaposition.  Make it more effective by removing the railing at the bottom left.  Perfect exposure - even with that horrendous sky.  Too bad you don''t see a bit more of the red light.', '2004-06-09 15:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(757242, 82391, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very special.  Nice composition, exposure.</td>', 'Very special.  Nice composition, exposure.', '2004-06-09 15:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(757250, 82275, 20115, '<td valign="top">You must be new.  I did the same resizing mistake.  Also is looks to dark to make out who exactly is waiting.  Perhaps because it is too small, it is hard to see.  There is some info about resizing on DP Challenge--check it out.</td>', 'You must be new.  I did the same resizing mistake.  Also is looks to dark to make out who exactly is waiting.  Perhaps because it is too small, it is hard to see.  There is some info about resizing on DP Challenge--check it out.', '2004-06-09 15:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(757252, 82487, 20115, '<td valign="top">Don''t really like shots that are too staged or contrived.  However, I like the over the shoulder composition.</td>', 'Don''t really like shots that are too staged or contrived.  However, I like the over the shoulder composition.', '2004-06-09 15:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(757253, 82304, 22677, '<td valign="top">I like the image of the child looking through the galss, but I think I would have cropped  a little closer, I also  wonder if the composition would be better without the plant?  Also the angle looks a little off.<br/></td>', 'I like the image of the child looking through the galss, but I think I would have cropped  a little closer, I also  wonder if the composition would be better without the plant?  Also the angle looks a little off.', '2004-06-09 15:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(757254, 82299, 20115, '<td valign="top">I think this shot could have done without the out of focus fence.</td>', 'I think this shot could have done without the out of focus fence.', '2004-06-09 15:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(757256, 82167, 20115, '<td valign="top">Love animal shots, but this needs to be brightened up a bit.</td>', 'Love animal shots, but this needs to be brightened up a bit.', '2004-06-09 15:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(757258, 82161, 20115, '<td valign="top">Definitely--good idea.</td>', 'Definitely--good idea.', '2004-06-09 15:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(757259, 82338, 22680, '<td valign="top">I like this one, nice colour.</td>', 'I like this one, nice colour.', '2004-06-09 15:20:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(757261, 82124, 20115, '<td valign="top">Steamy--the silhouette here is a good choice.</td>', 'Steamy--the silhouette here is a good choice.', '2004-06-09 15:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(757263, 81492, 20115, '<td valign="top">The most magical waiting period every.  Nice.</td>', 'The most magical waiting period every.  Nice.', '2004-06-09 15:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(757266, 81659, 22478, '<td valign="top">When my eye is drawn to the subject on the left, I wonder, "Where''s the waiting?"  When my eye sees the subject''s reflection in the mirror, THEN I realizes the subject is pregnant.  While the photographer''s concept is good, it takes too long to identify the element of waiting.  A more direct composition of the subject''s tummy, perhaps with a calendar in the background, would have conveyed "waiting" much more clearly.</td>', 'When my eye is drawn to the subject on the left, I wonder, "Where''s the waiting?"  When my eye sees the subject''s reflection in the mirror, THEN I realizes the subject is pregnant.  While the photographer''s concept is good, it takes too long to identify the element of waiting.  A more direct composition of the subject''s tummy, perhaps with a calendar in the background, would have conveyed "waiting" much more clearly.', '2004-06-09 15:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(757269, 81479, 20115, '<td valign="top">What a face.  She is really really cute.  I have a blue-eyed red head also--only she is 24.  I think this should have been really focused sharp so we wouldn''t  miss anything of that sweet cherubic face.</td>', 'What a face.  She is really really cute.  I have a blue-eyed red head also--only she is 24.  I think this should have been really focused sharp so we wouldn''t  miss anything of that sweet cherubic face.', '2004-06-09 15:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(757272, 81784, 21362, '<td valign="top">Beautiful butterfly!</td>', 'Beautiful butterfly!', '2004-06-09 15:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(757273, 81313, 22478, '<td valign="top">The notion of waiting is clearly conveyed in the subject and environment.  The foreground is verify distracting--a shot down the platform, parallel to the tracks would have been better.</td>', 'The notion of waiting is clearly conveyed in the subject and environment.  The foreground is verify distracting--a shot down the platform, parallel to the tracks would have been better.', '2004-06-09 15:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(757274, 82068, 20115, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable--where do you find these baby birds--are you climbing trees?</td>', 'Unbelievable--where do you find these baby birds--are you climbing trees?', '2004-06-09 15:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(757276, 81567, 20115, '<td valign="top">You should do well in the next challenge.</td>', 'You should do well in the next challenge.', '2004-06-09 15:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(757277, 81543, 20115, '<td valign="top">Out of focus does not work for me.</td>', 'Out of focus does not work for me.', '2004-06-09 15:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(757283, 81363, 20115, '<td valign="top">Go into the light, go into the light.  I can smell the day.  Very nice.</td>', 'Go into the light, go into the light.  I can smell the day.  Very nice.', '2004-06-09 15:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(757284, 81805, 327, '<td valign="top">I think your idea is cute and colorful.The problem is too much going on..it''s busy. Maybe just a few pairs and less of the distracting background. &lt;?&gt;</td>', 'I think your idea is cute and colorful.The problem is too much going on..it''s busy. Maybe just a few pairs and less of the distracting background. <?>', '2004-06-09 15:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(757286, 82208, 20115, '<td valign="top">This is really an amazing shot.  It looks like a gigantic web from the angle you chose.</td>', 'This is really an amazing shot.  It looks like a gigantic web from the angle you chose.', '2004-06-09 15:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(757287, 81129, 327, '<td valign="top">Not bad I like this. Maybe remove the flare after the challenge. Keeper.</td>', 'Not bad I like this. Maybe remove the flare after the challenge. Keeper.', '2004-06-09 15:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(757288, 82348, 327, '<td valign="top">lol Very cute. Tighter crop to remove the over exposed window on the left.</td>', 'lol Very cute. Tighter crop to remove the over exposed window on the left.', '2004-06-09 15:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(757289, 81718, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and nice POV I like because you  got down low. Good entry.</td>', 'Nice colors and nice POV I like because you  got down low. Good entry.', '2004-06-09 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(757291, 81705, 22478, '<td valign="top">Effective choice of subject.  Background has too much clutter.</td>', 'Effective choice of subject.  Background has too much clutter.', '2004-06-09 15:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(757292, 81152, 20115, '<td valign="top">I know she is blue, but it''s too blue for me.</td>', 'I know she is blue, but it''s too blue for me.', '2004-06-09 15:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(757293, 82495, 327, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tighter crop on the left..&lt;?&gt; Good entry.</td>', 'Maybe a tighter crop on the left..<?> Good entry.', '2004-06-09 15:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(757294, 81744, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty ...like this one. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty ...like this one. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-06-09 15:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(757295, 82362, 20115, '<td valign="top">Just Gorgeous!</td>', 'Just Gorgeous!', '2004-06-09 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(757297, 82352, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors...who knew? lol Nice macro.</td>', 'Pretty colors...who knew? lol Nice macro.', '2004-06-09 15:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(757300, 81152, 327, '<td valign="top">I can relate. Good entry, love the light.</td>', 'I can relate. Good entry, love the light.', '2004-06-09 15:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
