(757643, 82442, 21621, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, not sure if I get the sense of waiting, or just passing time, but regardless, nice work.</td>', 'This is a great shot, not sure if I get the sense of waiting, or just passing time, but regardless, nice work.', '2004-06-09 19:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(757645, 81731, 8860, '<td valign="top">Intriguing spider and a nice, crisp shot. Mispelled title though - ''doh!''  :D<br/> <br/>If this had been an editing challenge it would have been nice to lose the shadow on the left, but it certainly subtracts nothing from the interest in this. Hope you do well.</td>', 'Intriguing spider and a nice, crisp shot. Mispelled title though - ''doh!''  :D If this had been an editing challenge it would have been nice to lose the shadow on the left, but it certainly subtracts nothing from the interest in this. Hope you do well.', '2004-06-09 19:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(757647, 82131, 21905, '<td valign="top">Very cool birdies!</td>', 'Very cool birdies!', '2004-06-09 19:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(757649, 82102, 21058, '<td valign="top">Picture so inspiring... i like the colors and the composition!</td>', 'Picture so inspiring... i like the colors and the composition!', '2004-06-09 19:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(757650, 82392, 21058, '<td valign="top">yeurk!! Had this at home???</td>', 'yeurk!! Had this at home???', '2004-06-09 19:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(757651, 82346, 21621, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the motion blur, might benefit from a tighter crop on the bottom, but great work anyway.</td>', 'Very nice, I like the motion blur, might benefit from a tighter crop on the bottom, but great work anyway.', '2004-06-09 19:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(757655, 81769, 19134, '<td valign="top">Funny shot!</td>', 'Funny shot!', '2004-06-09 19:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(757656, 81679, 8860, '<td valign="top">Shot is too dark, sloppily composed (tilted) and has little of interest to hold the viewer. It sounds harsh but I believe in honesty - so sorry if this angers you.<br/> <br/>Some remedies that spring to mind are:<br/>1. shoot from anything other than eye level (above the head or floor level perhaps)<br/>2. find a focal point - a platform being swept, a man looking at watch, a baby crying - anything!<br/>3. get into a position where you have some good light on the subject or use the flash but diffuse it by wrapping it in tissue paper so that you don''t bleach out subjects close to the camera.</td>', 'Shot is too dark, sloppily composed (tilted) and has little of interest to hold the viewer. It sounds harsh but I believe in honesty - so sorry if this angers you. Some remedies that spring to mind are:1. shoot from anything other than eye level (above the head or floor level perhaps)2. find a focal point - a platform being swept, a man looking at watch, a baby crying - anything!3. get into a position where you have some good light on the subject or use the flash but diffuse it by wrapping it in tissue paper so that you don''t bleach out subjects close to the camera.', '2004-06-09 19:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(757657, 82398, 19134, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot.', '2004-06-09 19:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(757658, 81265, 21905, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2004-06-09 19:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
