(757853, 81547, 21198, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen some other insect photos in this challenge. I like the other ones that display the insect look like it will take off. The insect here is pointing down. If the insect here were pointing up, it would much more convey the idea that it could fly off at any moment. But right now it looks like it just landed because it''s pointing downward.</td>', 'I''ve seen some other insect photos in this challenge. I like the other ones that display the insect look like it will take off. The insect here is pointing down. If the insect here were pointing up, it would much more convey the idea that it could fly off at any moment. But right now it looks like it just landed because it''s pointing downward.', '2004-06-09 21:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
