(757926, 81830, 19944, '<td valign="top">Gee, reminds me of last year on my own front porch.  Except your plant looks healthy.  We stopped watering ours, so as not to disturb the doves.  The fun part is watching how quickly the chicks grow.  It''s amazing.<br/> <br/>Anyway, very nice shot.</td>', 'Gee, reminds me of last year on my own front porch.  Except your plant looks healthy.  We stopped watering ours, so as not to disturb the doves.  The fun part is watching how quickly the chicks grow.  It''s amazing. Anyway, very nice shot.', '2004-06-09 21:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
