(758144, 81912, 20832, '<td valign="top">Hahaha! Very original</td>', 'Hahaha! Very original', '2004-06-10 01:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(758151, 82294, 9747, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I like the wash out effect, it brings attention to the subject yet retains the sky and mountain scenery. I like how the subject isn''t placed in the center. The strings above the subject''s head is a bit distracting, but that''s the only gripe from me. Excellent image!</td>', 'Very nice! I like the wash out effect, it brings attention to the subject yet retains the sky and mountain scenery. I like how the subject isn''t placed in the center. The strings above the subject''s head is a bit distracting, but that''s the only gripe from me. Excellent image!', '2004-06-10 02:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(758159, 82221, 22217, '<td valign="top">but they are already running...<br/></td>', 'but they are already running...', '2004-06-10 02:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(758161, 82186, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nice quiet siloette, which I can''t spell worth a darn. However, your picture suffers immensely from the slanted horizon.</td>', 'Nice quiet siloette, which I can''t spell worth a darn. However, your picture suffers immensely from the slanted horizon.', '2004-06-10 02:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(758162, 82145, 9747, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Only a couple nitpicks: I wish the dog''s bottom lip wasn''t cropped out, and the background should be a bit more blurry. Otherwise, beautiful dog, great expression. Fantastic!</td>', 'Beautiful! Only a couple nitpicks: I wish the dog''s bottom lip wasn''t cropped out, and the background should be a bit more blurry. Otherwise, beautiful dog, great expression. Fantastic!', '2004-06-10 02:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(758164, 82487, 9747, '<td valign="top">The female subject''s watch is placed somewhat awkwardly (not exactly on her wrist), and she''s pointing to the back of her hand instead of the watch.  The male subject''s left hand shouldn''t be cropped off, in my opinion. However, great acting by both subjects and the picture fits the theme very well!</td>', 'The female subject''s watch is placed somewhat awkwardly (not exactly on her wrist), and she''s pointing to the back of her hand instead of the watch.  The male subject''s left hand shouldn''t be cropped off, in my opinion. However, great acting by both subjects and the picture fits the theme very well!', '2004-06-10 02:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(758170, 81643, 9747, '<td valign="top">The picture''s too tilted (needs to be rotated slightly to the right) and the restroom''s sign is askewed too. But I love the young models'' acting (I''m assuming this was arranged), wish I can see the white-shirted model''s face. Good idea in making this black and white. The picture gave me a chuckle when I saw it. Way to go!</td>', 'The picture''s too tilted (needs to be rotated slightly to the right) and the restroom''s sign is askewed too. But I love the young models'' acting (I''m assuming this was arranged), wish I can see the white-shirted model''s face. Good idea in making this black and white. The picture gave me a chuckle when I saw it. Way to go!', '2004-06-10 02:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(758173, 81741, 9747, '<td valign="top">Picture too small and blurry. However, nice freeze-action! I like the feel of anticipation as the batter gets ready to hit the ball. Definitely fits the theme.</td>', 'Picture too small and blurry. However, nice freeze-action! I like the feel of anticipation as the batter gets ready to hit the ball. Definitely fits the theme.', '2004-06-10 02:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(758188, 81363, 9747, '<td valign="top">Wow. Are the sun rays for real? Gorgeous! Very spiritual feeling. I wish the fire hydrant (left) and the sign/phone lines (right) weren''t there, but obviously those couldn''t be helped. I think the overall image might need slightly more yellow but even so, I like the picture as is. Kudos!</td>', 'Wow. Are the sun rays for real? Gorgeous! Very spiritual feeling. I wish the fire hydrant (left) and the sign/phone lines (right) weren''t there, but obviously those couldn''t be helped. I think the overall image might need slightly more yellow but even so, I like the picture as is. Kudos!', '2004-06-10 02:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(758189, 81737, 9747, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous picture! I know there is a similar picture (exact same rock and background) like this one, so my guess is that the model is Heida and the photographer is Nazgul. ;-) Anyhow, I absolutely love the scene and how the model is positioned. So serene, very peaceful feeling. Like the other picture, I also wish there were a bit more color, perhaps more redness in the sky to compliment the overall blueness. Superb picture!</td>', 'Gorgeous picture! I know there is a similar picture (exact same rock and background) like this one, so my guess is that the model is Heida and the photographer is Nazgul. ;-) Anyhow, I absolutely love the scene and how the model is positioned. So serene, very peaceful feeling. Like the other picture, I also wish there were a bit more color, perhaps more redness in the sky to compliment the overall blueness. Superb picture!', '2004-06-10 02:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(758190, 82362, 9747, '<td valign="top">Amazing picture. The water is so calm, extremely mirror-like! There are no obvious ripples that I can see. I love how the subject''s silhouette doesn''t interfere with the dark areas in the background. I only wish there were a bit more color, perhaps more redness in the sky to compliment the overall blueness. All in all, beautiful shot! My guess: Model must be Nazgul and photographer must be Heida. ;-)</td>', 'Amazing picture. The water is so calm, extremely mirror-like! There are no obvious ripples that I can see. I love how the subject''s silhouette doesn''t interfere with the dark areas in the background. I only wish there were a bit more color, perhaps more redness in the sky to compliment the overall blueness. All in all, beautiful shot! My guess: Model must be Nazgul and photographer must be Heida. ;-)', '2004-06-10 02:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(758202, 82338, 14202, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but I feel the ppl to the front would look better with some infill light.</td>', 'Good concept, but I feel the ppl to the front would look better with some infill light.', '2004-06-10 03:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
