(758400, 82380, 19952, '<td valign="top">This was probably the most interesting shot of the challenge for me. Better lighting would have probably improved it a bit, but who wants to lug lights out to their deck in the rain? :-) But even with natural light, this is a really excellent photo. Great job.</td>', 'This was probably the most interesting shot of the challenge for me. Better lighting would have probably improved it a bit, but who wants to lug lights out to their deck in the rain? :-) But even with natural light, this is a really excellent photo. Great job.', '2004-06-10 08:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
