(758414, 81607, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a great photo for this challenge. It could be a bit sharper and brighter, but this is a really nice shot. Great job!</td>', 'Wow - what a great photo for this challenge. It could be a bit sharper and brighter, but this is a really nice shot. Great job!', '2004-06-10 09:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
