(758640, 81542, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very nice, clean composition.  The skin tone is sort of an off color, but this REALLY fits the challenge well.  I like your border, too.  8</td>', 'Very nice, clean composition.  The skin tone is sort of an off color, but this REALLY fits the challenge well.  I like your border, too.  8', '2004-06-10 13:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(758641, 81145, 19035, '<td valign="top">I love the look in their eyes - 7</td>', 'I love the look in their eyes - 7', '2004-06-10 13:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(758644, 81643, 5391, '<td valign="top">It''s distrubing that her fingers seem to be in her mouth - kind of looks like she''s going to bite them.  Other than that, good composition and fits the challenge well.</td>', 'It''s distrubing that her fingers seem to be in her mouth - kind of looks like she''s going to bite them.  Other than that, good composition and fits the challenge well.', '2004-06-10 13:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(758655, 82495, 5391, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition, with the subject leaning in to the frame and the traffic headed towards the viewer.  You really feel them coming together, adding to the "waiting" feel.  Nice work.  Even the blown out highlights word well since it''s a bit of a high contrast shot.  Another little detail I really like is the way the light falls on the back of the bench he''s sitting on.  Overall a very strong image.  8</td>', 'I really like the composition, with the subject leaning in to the frame and the traffic headed towards the viewer.  You really feel them coming together, adding to the "waiting" feel.  Nice work.  Even the blown out highlights word well since it''s a bit of a high contrast shot.  Another little detail I really like is the way the light falls on the back of the bench he''s sitting on.  Overall a very strong image.  8', '2004-06-10 13:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(758656, 81691, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the shallow depth of field and the muted colors.</td>', 'Nice.  I like the shallow depth of field and the muted colors.', '2004-06-10 13:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(758658, 81140, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nice catch.  The colors are interesting, providing a gritty feel.  I wish the contrast wasn''t so high in his face, but overall a good shot.  A stretch for a "waiting" challenge, maybe, but still a really good and visually interesting shot.</td>', 'Nice catch.  The colors are interesting, providing a gritty feel.  I wish the contrast wasn''t so high in his face, but overall a good shot.  A stretch for a "waiting" challenge, maybe, but still a really good and visually interesting shot.', '2004-06-10 13:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
