(758800, 82387, 9295, '<td valign="top">I reckon you''ll get some comments about the washed out lighting at the top of this shot, but I like it...it makes the little girl all the more the focal point.  I think this shot is just hysterical and perfectly captured. Black and white was a good choice. I gave you a 10.</td>', 'I reckon you''ll get some comments about the washed out lighting at the top of this shot, but I like it...it makes the little girl all the more the focal point.  I think this shot is just hysterical and perfectly captured. Black and white was a good choice. I gave you a 10.', '2004-06-10 16:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(758827, 81649, 18374, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this photo could be improved by a shallower depth of field.  More blurring of the background might make the shot easier on the eyes and help the subject stand out more.  Alternatively you could add some extra lighting on the main subject to focus attention on it.</td>', 'In my opinion, this photo could be improved by a shallower depth of field.  More blurring of the background might make the shot easier on the eyes and help the subject stand out more.  Alternatively you could add some extra lighting on the main subject to focus attention on it.', '2004-06-10 16:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
