(758872, 82444, 18374, '<td valign="top">I think some creative lighting could improve this shot a lot.  The shadow the flash casts on the dog''s face looks funny.  The bright doorjamb is the only part of the photo that stands out.  I think some back lighting from inside the house would focus attention on the dog and not on the scratched up door.</td>', 'I think some creative lighting could improve this shot a lot.  The shadow the flash casts on the dog''s face looks funny.  The bright doorjamb is the only part of the photo that stands out.  I think some back lighting from inside the house would focus attention on the dog and not on the scratched up door.', '2004-06-10 17:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(758873, 82193, 18374, '<td valign="top">The focus looks a bit soft in some areas of the flower.  It also looks a little underexposed to me.  I would prefer some more light on the leaves to help them stand out from the background.</td>', 'The focus looks a bit soft in some areas of the flower.  It also looks a little underexposed to me.  I would prefer some more light on the leaves to help them stand out from the background.', '2004-06-10 17:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
