(758898, 81726, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice cropping and excellent colors.  I''d have given this a 9 if the nose had been in focus as the detail in the eyes is amazing.</td>', 'Nice cropping and excellent colors.  I''d have given this a 9 if the nose had been in focus as the detail in the eyes is amazing.', '2004-06-10 18:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(758905, 81002, 20204, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent portrait - you nailed the lighting, and the expression fits the title perfectly.  It''s unfortunate that it''s got the dull and busy background it does.  With a clean background this would be outstanding in every way to me.</td>', 'This is an excellent portrait - you nailed the lighting, and the expression fits the title perfectly.  It''s unfortunate that it''s got the dull and busy background it does.  With a clean background this would be outstanding in every way to me.', '2004-06-10 18:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(758909, 81769, 20204, '<td valign="top">The row of toilets is tilted clockwise, but what I can''t get past is that there''s nothing to connect me to this image.  It''s just a line of toilests with completely disassociated subjects walking in front of it.  If your subject was meant to be the line it may have helped to take the shot from a perspective that puts more people in the frame.</td>', 'The row of toilets is tilted clockwise, but what I can''t get past is that there''s nothing to connect me to this image.  It''s just a line of toilests with completely disassociated subjects walking in front of it.  If your subject was meant to be the line it may have helped to take the shot from a perspective that puts more people in the frame.', '2004-06-10 18:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(758910, 81479, 20204, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit of a color cast and blurring going on in this image, as well as overexposure outside the window.  It would also help to take the shot from more of an eye-level perspective to emphasize the child''s facial details more than her hair.  Eye-level portraits tend to be more engaging as a starting place.</td>', 'There''s a bit of a color cast and blurring going on in this image, as well as overexposure outside the window.  It would also help to take the shot from more of an eye-level perspective to emphasize the child''s facial details more than her hair.  Eye-level portraits tend to be more engaging as a starting place.', '2004-06-10 18:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(758911, 82406, 21183, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  All the white space along with the ''hangin'' spider give an aura of ''waiting''.</td>', 'Good photo.  All the white space along with the ''hangin'' spider give an aura of ''waiting''.', '2004-06-10 18:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(758913, 81737, 22262, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.  The reflections in the water are perfect.  Captures the stillness of waiting.  I give this one a 7</td>', 'Very nice picture.  The reflections in the water are perfect.  Captures the stillness of waiting.  I give this one a 7', '2004-06-10 18:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(758914, 81607, 20204, '<td valign="top">This has a snapshot feel to it...  The subjects are filling so little of the frame that my eye wanders around the room rather than being drawn to the bored looks on the girls.  You''ve got a good idea, hust need to fill the frame more.</td>', 'This has a snapshot feel to it...  The subjects are filling so little of the frame that my eye wanders around the room rather than being drawn to the bored looks on the girls.  You''ve got a good idea, hust need to fill the frame more.', '2004-06-10 18:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
