(758985, 82459, 22892, '<td valign="top">Tighter framing (or maybe just change the angle so there''s less distraction) would have helped this a lot, because the sihoutted fishing guy with the ducks has a lot of potential.</td>', 'Tighter framing (or maybe just change the angle so there''s less distraction) would have helped this a lot, because the sihoutted fishing guy with the ducks has a lot of potential.', '2004-06-10 19:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
