(759304, 81294, 20235, '<td valign="top">When I clicked on this photo, I instantly felt emotion from it. I think it''s a good example of how a picture can connect with someone and mean different things to different people. In this case, I think it was the mood and feeling you captured, in context with my memories of my own father.... Anyways, use of b&amp;w for dramatic effect, sillouhette use, and the interplay of light and shadows, makes this very interesting. I like the way the lighting becomes suggestive against the man''s face and emphasizes the title. Hope it does well, I''m voting the only 9 i''ve given in this challenge</td>', 'When I clicked on this photo, I instantly felt emotion from it. I think it''s a good example of how a picture can connect with someone and mean different things to different people. In this case, I think it was the mood and feeling you captured, in context with my memories of my own father.... Anyways, use of b&w for dramatic effect, sillouhette use, and the interplay of light and shadows, makes this very interesting. I like the way the lighting becomes suggestive against the man''s face and emphasizes the title. Hope it does well, I''m voting the only 9 i''ve given in this challenge', '2004-06-11 01:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
