(759743, 82381, 18374, '<td valign="top">The background in this shot looks too much like the foreground- it is hard to tell where one stops and the other begins, particularly on the left hand side.  Some light on the forground might help it stand out more.</td>', 'The background in this shot looks too much like the foreground- it is hard to tell where one stops and the other begins, particularly on the left hand side.  Some light on the forground might help it stand out more.', '2004-06-11 15:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
