(759778, 81685, 19672, '<td valign="top">Nice but would have been more appealing if there was just a bit more focus on the the glass in hand. It''s just a bit too blurry for my eyes...</td>', 'Nice but would have been more appealing if there was just a bit more focus on the the glass in hand. It''s just a bit too blurry for my eyes...', '2004-06-11 15:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
