(759794, 82270, 19672, '<td valign="top">I just want to re-title this "I''m all ears..."</td>', 'I just want to re-title this "I''m all ears..."', '2004-06-11 15:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(759795, 82470, 18374, '<td valign="top">I think this shot has a lot of potential- the framing, focus and subject matter are all good.  The lighting is the main area that can be improved.  The light looks very flat and harsh washing out a lot of the contrast- it is hard to tell where the grass ends and trees begin.  For this reason, I think the conversion to B&amp;W may not have been an improvement.  (The old-time feel doesn''t work with all of the people wearing modern clothes anyway...)  Alternatively, some curves adjustments in software might be able to enhance the contrasts some to add some more "life" to the shot.</td>', 'I think this shot has a lot of potential- the framing, focus and subject matter are all good.  The lighting is the main area that can be improved.  The light looks very flat and harsh washing out a lot of the contrast- it is hard to tell where the grass ends and trees begin.  For this reason, I think the conversion to B&W may not have been an improvement.  (The old-time feel doesn''t work with all of the people wearing modern clothes anyway...)  Alternatively, some curves adjustments in software might be able to enhance the contrasts some to add some more "life" to the shot.', '2004-06-11 15:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(759800, 82045, 19672, '<td valign="top">If you titled this "Waiting to ride..." I think I''d have voted a point higher...</td>', 'If you titled this "Waiting to ride..." I think I''d have voted a point higher...', '2004-06-11 15:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(759804, 81691, 16106, '<td valign="top">While I love both the bird and the backround, I wish there was more of the former in the latter. Still given your lens selection a very nice shot.</td>', 'While I love both the bird and the backround, I wish there was more of the former in the latter. Still given your lens selection a very nice shot.', '2004-06-11 15:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(759806, 81968, 18374, '<td valign="top">I think there is some room for improvement on this shot.  I would recommend not using backlighting for this shot.  All of the colors are washed out- you can barely tell that the grass and trees are green.  Alternatively, full backlighting and underexposure so that you are only capturing a dark silohuette may work as well.  The pole at the right should be cropped out of the frame.  If the stop sign is intended to be the main point of interest, I would tighten the composition on it.  The background for this shot is not very interesting and doesn''t really need to be in the shot.</td>', 'I think there is some room for improvement on this shot.  I would recommend not using backlighting for this shot.  All of the colors are washed out- you can barely tell that the grass and trees are green.  Alternatively, full backlighting and underexposure so that you are only capturing a dark silohuette may work as well.  The pole at the right should be cropped out of the frame.  If the stop sign is intended to be the main point of interest, I would tighten the composition on it.  The background for this shot is not very interesting and doesn''t really need to be in the shot.', '2004-06-11 15:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(759807, 82260, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  I like the DOF and rain drops on the window.  Nice detail as well.</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  I like the DOF and rain drops on the window.  Nice detail as well.', '2004-06-11 15:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(759816, 82145, 9690, '<td valign="top">I love this!  Good job!</td>', 'I love this!  Good job!', '2004-06-11 15:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
