(759819, 81726, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I think I would have preferred a slightly greater DOF to have the nose and mouth in focus too.  The focus on they eyes is very sharp.</td>', 'Nice!  I think I would have preferred a slightly greater DOF to have the nose and mouth in focus too.  The focus on they eyes is very sharp.', '2004-06-11 15:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
