(760059, 81114, 21478, '<td valign="top">This seems (to me) to be just a snapshot with not much thought in it. The lady has red-eye reflection (generally caused by oncamera flash). There are some kind of flare or hanging lights behind the mans head (distracting and difficult to focus on). and the general lighting is poor (flash falloff). Without the title, you wouldn''t really know it was "Waiting" - more like "upset" or "bored".</td>', 'This seems (to me) to be just a snapshot with not much thought in it. The lady has red-eye reflection (generally caused by oncamera flash). There are some kind of flare or hanging lights behind the mans head (distracting and difficult to focus on). and the general lighting is poor (flash falloff). Without the title, you wouldn''t really know it was "Waiting" - more like "upset" or "bored".', '2004-06-11 19:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
