(760117, 82362, 22046, '<td valign="top">One of my two top images in this challenge. I like the sharp focus on the fisherman. Having him in profile shows clearly who he is and what he''s doing. The sunset just adds to an already well-composed image.</td>', 'One of my two top images in this challenge. I like the sharp focus on the fisherman. Having him in profile shows clearly who he is and what he''s doing. The sunset just adds to an already well-composed image.', '2004-06-11 20:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
