(762328, 80972, 22748, '<td valign="top">Pity.  I really do like the picture- the model is great, the lighting on her face is nice (maybe could use some improvement to the background and the shadows cast on her body though).   But, unfortunately... it looks like crap: I can barely see the photo through the JPEG artifacts. You have up to 150 KB, but the image was saved with such low quality that it only uses 26 KB.  Either that or it was taken on an ancient 0.3 megapixel digicam. :-(</td>', 'Pity.  I really do like the picture- the model is great, the lighting on her face is nice (maybe could use some improvement to the background and the shadows cast on her body though).   But, unfortunately... it looks like crap: I can barely see the photo through the JPEG artifacts. You have up to 150 KB, but the image was saved with such low quality that it only uses 26 KB.  Either that or it was taken on an ancient 0.3 megapixel digicam. :-(', '2004-06-14 04:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(762333, 81685, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice! Oh, and thanks for the excellent title. I would probably not have known what kind of plant this was otherwise... oops! almost didn''t notice the wine glass in the background. Nice DOF! That just bumped this one up to a 9.</td>', 'Nice! Oh, and thanks for the excellent title. I would probably not have known what kind of plant this was otherwise... oops! almost didn''t notice the wine glass in the background. Nice DOF! That just bumped this one up to a 9.', '2004-06-14 04:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
