(762338, 82422, 22011, '<td valign="top">There probably is a lot of waiting to do at a lock, but the wind on the flags, and the water escaping from the gate dosn''t make me thing waiting.  It would have been great if you could have got a shot of a boat in the lock...</td>', 'There probably is a lot of waiting to do at a lock, but the wind on the flags, and the water escaping from the gate dosn''t make me thing waiting.  It would have been great if you could have got a shot of a boat in the lock...', '2004-06-14 04:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
