(762620, 82005, 22418, '<td valign="top">fuzzy, grainy appears that you focused on the lettering of the shirt thus creating the fuzziness of the face</td>', 'fuzzy, grainy appears that you focused on the lettering of the shirt thus creating the fuzziness of the face', '2004-06-14 11:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(762629, 82174, 7560, '<td valign="top">This has great potential. There are too many distractions in the background though. It''s taking away from the central focus of the shot. Depending on your camera, try shooting in macro mode or using a very shallow DOF. that will blur out the background and allow us to focus on the face. I''d also get lower.  Reposition your model against a less cluttered backdrop. If need be, you can use a sheet as your backdrop. He''s got great expressive eyes. You want them to be the focus. I''d also consider a tighter crop. 5</td>', 'This has great potential. There are too many distractions in the background though. It''s taking away from the central focus of the shot. Depending on your camera, try shooting in macro mode or using a very shallow DOF. that will blur out the background and allow us to focus on the face. I''d also get lower.  Reposition your model against a less cluttered backdrop. If need be, you can use a sheet as your backdrop. He''s got great expressive eyes. You want them to be the focus. I''d also consider a tighter crop. 5', '2004-06-14 11:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(762655, 81354, 13136, '<td valign="top">I think the outside needs more contrast.</td>', 'I think the outside needs more contrast.', '2004-06-14 12:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(762656, 82311, 13136, '<td valign="top">The highlights just don''t work for me in this shot.  The focus appears to be more on the surface behind the watch than on the watch face.</td>', 'The highlights just don''t work for me in this shot.  The focus appears to be more on the surface behind the watch than on the watch face.', '2004-06-14 12:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(762660, 81948, 13136, '<td valign="top">This shot implies action much more than waiting.</td>', 'This shot implies action much more than waiting.', '2004-06-14 12:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(762668, 82156, 22748, '<td valign="top">LOL! This is very creative. Fabulous setup. I''d give this an 9 if it were executed better, technically.  I have to knock off 4 points though, because the lighting and exposure seem a little dark, it''s very blocky and grainy, all detracting a lot from what would otherwise be a great image.</td>', 'LOL! This is very creative. Fabulous setup. I''d give this an 9 if it were executed better, technically.  I have to knock off 4 points though, because the lighting and exposure seem a little dark, it''s very blocky and grainy, all detracting a lot from what would otherwise be a great image.', '2004-06-14 12:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(762673, 81763, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good composition and subject. Shot looks a bit hazy.</td>', 'Good composition and subject. Shot looks a bit hazy.', '2004-06-14 12:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(762676, 82141, 21611, '<td valign="top">A terrific shot. I gave it a seven only because I am picky about "meeting the challenge"  I think the shot has to describe "waiting" not the title. Having said that it was one of my favorites. and I would have scored it higher for another challenge.<br/>Good work</td>', 'A terrific shot. I gave it a seven only because I am picky about "meeting the challenge"  I think the shot has to describe "waiting" not the title. Having said that it was one of my favorites. and I would have scored it higher for another challenge.Good work', '2004-06-14 12:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(762686, 82362, 8522, '<td valign="top">I slightly prefer this photo to the one taken by the model in this photo, I presume! The composition seems a tad more balanced here, but the elements both photos have in common is great... wonderful light, stillness, silhouttes, etc. I prefer the lack of leaves at the top of the frame in this one. I also prefer the reflection of the person in this photo. Wonderful</td>', 'I slightly prefer this photo to the one taken by the model in this photo, I presume! The composition seems a tad more balanced here, but the elements both photos have in common is great... wonderful light, stillness, silhouttes, etc. I prefer the lack of leaves at the top of the frame in this one. I also prefer the reflection of the person in this photo. Wonderful', '2004-06-14 12:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(762690, 82068, 9809, '<td valign="top">A little greater DOF would have helped this shot a notch or two. The bird''s eye and leading edge of beak are out of focus and that blurred part is what keeps drawing my eye.</td>', 'A little greater DOF would have helped this shot a notch or two. The bird''s eye and leading edge of beak are out of focus and that blurred part is what keeps drawing my eye.', '2004-06-14 12:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(762768, 81114, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. But, the on-camera flash is unnatural, harsh and unflattering to the woman, and the BBQ in the background and the man are just too dark.  With proper lighting and exposure, this would be a nice picture.</td>', 'I like the idea. But, the on-camera flash is unnatural, harsh and unflattering to the woman, and the BBQ in the background and the man are just too dark.  With proper lighting and exposure, this would be a nice picture.', '2004-06-14 13:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(762827, 82141, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great picture! Perfect shutter speed to capture the raindrops'' motion. Only, I don''t feel like she is waiting for anything, but she seems to be kind of content in the rain. Still, it''s more on the topic than so many I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Great picture! Perfect shutter speed to capture the raindrops'' motion. Only, I don''t feel like she is waiting for anything, but she seems to be kind of content in the rain. Still, it''s more on the topic than so many I''ve seen so far.', '2004-06-14 15:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(762833, 82204, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice even lighting on the face, interesting facial expression. Only, it''s too bad the child was hacked off at the knees, that kind of hurt the composition. I wonder if a portrait-orientation shot of just the child (a little less empty space) would be even better.</td>', 'Great shot. Nice even lighting on the face, interesting facial expression. Only, it''s too bad the child was hacked off at the knees, that kind of hurt the composition. I wonder if a portrait-orientation shot of just the child (a little less empty space) would be even better.', '2004-06-14 15:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(762839, 82291, 22748, '<td valign="top">Not a bad photograph, but I can''t tell what he''s waiting for.</td>', 'Not a bad photograph, but I can''t tell what he''s waiting for.', '2004-06-14 15:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(762862, 82275, 20679, '<td valign="top">Shame this is so small, we can''t see it clearly. Use the full 640 pixels we are allowed.</td>', 'Shame this is so small, we can''t see it clearly. Use the full 640 pixels we are allowed.', '2004-06-14 15:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(762864, 82272, 20679, '<td valign="top">shame her head is cropped....nice character study though</td>', 'shame her head is cropped....nice character study though', '2004-06-14 15:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(762883, 82124, 12733, '<td valign="top">The use of silhouette is very effective, as is the choice of black and white. The picture immediately forces the viewer to wonder what she is waiting for.</td>', 'The use of silhouette is very effective, as is the choice of black and white. The picture immediately forces the viewer to wonder what she is waiting for.', '2004-06-14 15:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(762885, 81549, 12733, '<td valign="top">There''s a definite sense of waiting here. I think a wide, panoramic crop would have conveyed the feeling more effectively; the tops of the buildings distract from the subject.</td>', 'There''s a definite sense of waiting here. I think a wide, panoramic crop would have conveyed the feeling more effectively; the tops of the buildings distract from the subject.', '2004-06-14 15:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(762888, 81155, 12733, '<td valign="top">The colors and textures on the building are arresting and outstanding. The waiting crowd seems almost an afterthought, though they are clearly the subject of the picture. What is the peril inside?</td>', 'The colors and textures on the building are arresting and outstanding. The waiting crowd seems almost an afterthought, though they are clearly the subject of the picture. What is the peril inside?', '2004-06-14 15:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(762890, 82470, 18349, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo.   Treatment works well...don''t you wish you could get rid of those guys over there????  ;o)</td>', 'Lovely photo.   Treatment works well...don''t you wish you could get rid of those guys over there????  ;o)', '2004-06-14 15:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(762891, 81972, 13136, '<td valign="top">Should have taken off your watch. At least that''s what my wife tells me.</td>', 'Should have taken off your watch. At least that''s what my wife tells me.', '2004-06-14 15:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(762893, 82346, 12733, '<td valign="top">The reflections on the wet roadway, the umbrellas and the muted light are very effective. The blur of moving buses adds an original touch.</td>', 'The reflections on the wet roadway, the umbrellas and the muted light are very effective. The blur of moving buses adds an original touch.', '2004-06-14 15:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(762899, 81764, 12733, '<td valign="top">...and not very patiently. Very pretty shot, it really captures the essence of cat. Could stand a bit more DOF; the fur just behind the face and the ends of the whiskers are out of focus.</td>', '...and not very patiently. Very pretty shot, it really captures the essence of cat. Could stand a bit more DOF; the fur just behind the face and the ends of the whiskers are out of focus.', '2004-06-14 15:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(762903, 81625, 12733, '<td valign="top">Waiting to pounce? Nice rendering of the colors and textures of these attractive chess pieces.</td>', 'Waiting to pounce? Nice rendering of the colors and textures of these attractive chess pieces.', '2004-06-14 15:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(762905, 82138, 12733, '<td valign="top">I sure wish I could see the train; it seems just a blur in the background.</td>', 'I sure wish I could see the train; it seems just a blur in the background.', '2004-06-14 15:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(762908, 82053, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty night shot of an attractive building. I think the connection to the theme is a bit stretched, though.</td>', 'Very pretty night shot of an attractive building. I think the connection to the theme is a bit stretched, though.', '2004-06-14 15:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
