(762940, 82485, 12733, '<td valign="top">I used to tell my dog, "be patient," and he would get just this kind of look on his face. Nice color and texture, could be a touch brighter.</td>', 'I used to tell my dog, "be patient," and he would get just this kind of look on his face. Nice color and texture, could be a touch brighter.', '2004-06-14 15:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(762945, 82205, 12733, '<td valign="top">An attractive model, and the toned b&amp;w is a good choice.</td>', 'An attractive model, and the toned b&w is a good choice.', '2004-06-14 15:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(762949, 82484, 12733, '<td valign="top">It''s unfortunate that you caught a spot where almost all the cars are black or white. I could imagine this shot with cars of every tone and hue lined up. It does make a nice pattern, though.</td>', 'It''s unfortunate that you caught a spot where almost all the cars are black or white. I could imagine this shot with cars of every tone and hue lined up. It does make a nice pattern, though.', '2004-06-14 15:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
