(762952, 81041, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great expression, and the pose reflects the tension of waiting for the starter''s signal. Nice shot.</td>', 'Great expression, and the pose reflects the tension of waiting for the starter''s signal. Nice shot.', '2004-06-14 15:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
