(762955, 82390, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. These birds are so graceful, and the muted colors are right for this subject.</td>', 'Very nice shot. These birds are so graceful, and the muted colors are right for this subject.', '2004-06-14 16:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
