(762979, 82301, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the muted lighting and the textures. The contrast between bright and mid-tone in the background is distracting, even though it is - as it should be - out of focus.</td>', 'I like the muted lighting and the textures. The contrast between bright and mid-tone in the background is distracting, even though it is - as it should be - out of focus.', '2004-06-14 16:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(762981, 82192, 13119, '<td valign="top">Excellent tones!</td>', 'Excellent tones!', '2004-06-14 16:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(762983, 82446, 13119, '<td valign="top">great idea!<br/>Cashing in!</td>', 'great idea!Cashing in!', '2004-06-14 16:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(762984, 82318, 12733, '<td valign="top">Ironically, those doors look too nice. The picture expresses that beaten felling that life has to get better - it couldn''t get worse - but the way to a better day is not sitting and waiting. An expressive shot.</td>', 'Ironically, those doors look too nice. The picture expresses that beaten felling that life has to get better - it couldn''t get worse - but the way to a better day is not sitting and waiting. An expressive shot.', '2004-06-14 16:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(762985, 81155, 13119, '<td valign="top">Nice POV</td>', 'Nice POV', '2004-06-14 16:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(762986, 82463, 13119, '<td valign="top">i can feel the wait for the pain!</td>', 'i can feel the wait for the pain!', '2004-06-14 16:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(762988, 81786, 13119, '<td valign="top">excellent colors!</td>', 'excellent colors!', '2004-06-14 16:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(762989, 82270, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute dog, nice surroundings, good color and texture.</td>', 'Cute dog, nice surroundings, good color and texture.', '2004-06-14 16:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(762990, 81769, 13119, '<td valign="top">i dont see anyone waiting but i get the concept</td>', 'i dont see anyone waiting but i get the concept', '2004-06-14 16:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(763078, 82131, 12399, '<td valign="top">First time I have seen baby spoonbills,,,, I have been trying to take photos of the spoonbills and am having a very hard time.  Great capture!</td>', 'First time I have seen baby spoonbills,,,, I have been trying to take photos of the spoonbills and am having a very hard time.  Great capture!', '2004-06-14 18:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(763079, 82286, 12399, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!  Love the contrasting colors!</td>', 'I love this photo!  Love the contrasting colors!', '2004-06-14 18:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(763082, 82304, 12399, '<td valign="top">I love these photos of the kids waiting for .......  I remember my grandson doing this very same thing waiting for his dad to come home.</td>', 'I love these photos of the kids waiting for .......  I remember my grandson doing this very same thing waiting for his dad to come home.', '2004-06-14 18:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(763083, 82045, 12399, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  I love this.</td>', 'Great photo!  I love this.', '2004-06-14 18:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(763084, 82068, 12399, '<td valign="top">Hehehe, good one!</td>', 'Hehehe, good one!', '2004-06-14 18:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(763086, 81607, 12399, '<td valign="top">LOL,  great photo!</td>', 'LOL,  great photo!', '2004-06-14 18:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(763087, 82469, 12399, '<td valign="top">Bet he is screaming his head off,  doesn''t look too patient to me ...  looks like ...  I want my food now!  lol  Great pic.</td>', 'Bet he is screaming his head off,  doesn''t look too patient to me ...  looks like ...  I want my food now!  lol  Great pic.', '2004-06-14 18:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(763088, 81925, 12399, '<td valign="top">Good one for this theme!</td>', 'Good one for this theme!', '2004-06-14 18:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(763089, 81985, 12399, '<td valign="top">I have a grandson and this is exactly how he looked waiting for his dad to come home!  Great photo!</td>', 'I have a grandson and this is exactly how he looked waiting for his dad to come home!  Great photo!', '2004-06-14 18:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(763091, 81547, 12399, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.</td>', 'I like this photo.', '2004-06-14 18:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(763093, 81659, 12399, '<td valign="top">Waiting is correct .... 9 months of it!!!</td>', 'Waiting is correct .... 9 months of it!!!', '2004-06-14 18:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(763094, 82391, 12399, '<td valign="top">Great photo for the theme ...  9 months of it!!</td>', 'Great photo for the theme ...  9 months of it!!', '2004-06-14 18:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(763095, 81475, 12399, '<td valign="top">Love this photo ....  great choice for the theme!</td>', 'Love this photo ....  great choice for the theme!', '2004-06-14 18:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(763096, 82329, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good journalistic shot. Very crisp and clear - if not to everyone''s taste or approval I''m sure. I''m certain this period of waiting must seem like an eternity for him.</td>', 'Good journalistic shot. Very crisp and clear - if not to everyone''s taste or approval I''m sure. I''m certain this period of waiting must seem like an eternity for him.', '2004-06-14 18:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(763098, 82191, 12399, '<td valign="top">Great photo, and great choice for the theme.</td>', 'Great photo, and great choice for the theme.', '2004-06-14 18:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(763100, 81805, 8860, '<td valign="top">Without the title the link would be a tenuous one. Aside from the challenge this is not a very engaging shot and is actually quite heavily pixelated. Shooting form the ground up may give the viewer more of a feeling of looking at the shoes from ''foot level''.</td>', 'Without the title the link would be a tenuous one. Aside from the challenge this is not a very engaging shot and is actually quite heavily pixelated. Shooting form the ground up may give the viewer more of a feeling of looking at the shoes from ''foot level''.', '2004-06-14 18:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(763101, 81912, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yes - we''ve all been there and frankly I think this person has chosen the best option.</td>', 'Yes - we''ve all been there and frankly I think this person has chosen the best option.', '2004-06-14 18:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(763102, 82147, 12399, '<td valign="top">Great choice for the theme ... I like it!</td>', 'Great choice for the theme ... I like it!', '2004-06-14 18:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(763103, 82198, 12399, '<td valign="top">I would be the one waiting for these. ...  I love vine ripened tomatoes!!</td>', 'I would be the one waiting for these. ...  I love vine ripened tomatoes!!', '2004-06-14 18:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(763104, 81389, 12399, '<td valign="top">love this one ...  I would be the one waiting, not for long for the red one, I would have already eaten that one.</td>', 'love this one ...  I would be the one waiting, not for long for the red one, I would have already eaten that one.', '2004-06-14 18:20:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(763105, 82008, 8860, '<td valign="top">Sad but we can''t lose sight of what we''re eating. It''s a pitiful existence really isn''t it? Shot''s OK but suffers from a little flash ''damage''.</td>', 'Sad but we can''t lose sight of what we''re eating. It''s a pitiful existence really isn''t it? Shot''s OK but suffers from a little flash ''damage''.', '2004-06-14 18:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(763109, 81542, 8860, '<td valign="top">I like this - it''s not perfect but it looks well proportioned. Frame is inappropriate though and, since it''s journalistic, it would be best left freestanding in my view.</td>', 'I like this - it''s not perfect but it looks well proportioned. Frame is inappropriate though and, since it''s journalistic, it would be best left freestanding in my view.', '2004-06-14 18:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(763110, 81294, 8860, '<td valign="top">Probably the winner. Very nice tones and sense of loneliness &amp; anticipation.</td>', 'Probably the winner. Very nice tones and sense of loneliness & anticipation.', '2004-06-14 18:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(763115, 82318, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very nice viewpoint and subject. Strong composition.</td>', 'Very nice viewpoint and subject. Strong composition.', '2004-06-14 18:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(763130, 82350, 8860, '<td valign="top">A cliche perhaps but nice DOF and it works.</td>', 'A cliche perhaps but nice DOF and it works.', '2004-06-14 18:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(763131, 81475, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nicely pushed colour and good capture.</td>', 'Nicely pushed colour and good capture.', '2004-06-14 18:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(763184, 82066, 12573, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is outstanding.  Not sure how you did it, but I love the sense of time and space here.  10.</td>', 'Wow.  This is outstanding.  Not sure how you did it, but I love the sense of time and space here.  10.', '2004-06-14 19:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(763189, 81090, 12573, '<td valign="top">Might want to use NeatImage a little less extremely.  The over softening of this portrait makes the composition too flat.</td>', 'Might want to use NeatImage a little less extremely.  The over softening of this portrait makes the composition too flat.', '2004-06-14 19:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(763196, 82350, 22166, '<td valign="top">could also be a "choice" entry?</td>', 'could also be a "choice" entry?', '2004-06-14 19:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(763277, 82205, 13487, '<td valign="top">Rooster??  Very sexy... nice capture!!</td>', 'Rooster??  Very sexy... nice capture!!', '2004-06-14 21:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(763290, 82141, 18318, '<td valign="top">amazing picture.</td>', 'amazing picture.', '2004-06-14 21:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(763294, 81547, 23050, '<td valign="top">This picture of the dragon fly is so nice.  Never seen any thing like it.</td>', 'This picture of the dragon fly is so nice.  Never seen any thing like it.', '2004-06-14 22:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(763312, 81047, 22995, '<td valign="top">My Dog looks a lot like this and also likes to balance bones on her nose</td>', 'My Dog looks a lot like this and also likes to balance bones on her nose', '2004-06-14 22:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(763323, 81047, 6520, '<td valign="top">9</td>', '9', '2004-06-14 22:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
