(763333, 81912, 14671, '<td valign="top">lol too funny</td>', 'lol too funny', '2004-06-14 22:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(763336, 81652, 14671, '<td valign="top">interesting shot/take on this challenge.  well done.  I really like the colors</td>', 'interesting shot/take on this challenge.  well done.  I really like the colors', '2004-06-14 22:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(763337, 82254, 14671, '<td valign="top">beautiful pic. great color.  well done</td>', 'beautiful pic. great color.  well done', '2004-06-14 22:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(763338, 81939, 14671, '<td valign="top">wow great shot</td>', 'wow great shot', '2004-06-14 22:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(763339, 81925, 14671, '<td valign="top">in my opinion this picture does not suggest or convey the feeling of waiting.</td>', 'in my opinion this picture does not suggest or convey the feeling of waiting.', '2004-06-14 22:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(763344, 80965, 11895, '<td valign="top">Good start</td>', 'Good start', '2004-06-14 22:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(763347, 81091, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great angle.</td>', 'Great angle.', '2004-06-14 22:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(763348, 81785, 2158, '<td valign="top">I wish you hadn''t cut his legs off.</td>', 'I wish you hadn''t cut his legs off.', '2004-06-14 22:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(763400, 82487, 2000, '<td valign="top">Challenge theme is captured well here.  Good composition, subject placement...</td>', 'Challenge theme is captured well here.  Good composition, subject placement...', '2004-06-14 23:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(763402, 81968, 2000, '<td valign="top">This photo appears too dark to me.  While I can tell that the STOP sign is there, it is overshadowed by the darkness in the shot.  Good attempt, however - challenge theme is definately captured here.</td>', 'This photo appears too dark to me.  While I can tell that the STOP sign is there, it is overshadowed by the darkness in the shot.  Good attempt, however - challenge theme is definately captured here.', '2004-06-14 23:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(763407, 81958, 2000, '<td valign="top">Cool lighting capture here.  I like the reflection on the web, although the spider itself is a bit blown out - not sure if that''s what you were going for, but I think this would be better is the spider was more visible.</td>', 'Cool lighting capture here.  I like the reflection on the web, although the spider itself is a bit blown out - not sure if that''s what you were going for, but I think this would be better is the spider was more visible.', '2004-06-14 23:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(763409, 81440, 2000, '<td valign="top">B/W works well here, and the feeling of waiting is most certainly apparent.  Nice work.</td>', 'B/W works well here, and the feeling of waiting is most certainly apparent.  Nice work.', '2004-06-14 23:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(763410, 82423, 2000, '<td valign="top">Looks to me more like she''s waiting for you to say ''yes, you can have candy.''  Nice portrait shot, except that she''s not completely in focus.</td>', 'Looks to me more like she''s waiting for you to say ''yes, you can have candy.''  Nice portrait shot, except that she''s not completely in focus.', '2004-06-14 23:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(763412, 81297, 2000, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping you commented on the concept here... yes, I get the timer and watch, but I''m sure you''re waiting for anything.</td>', 'I''m hoping you commented on the concept here... yes, I get the timer and watch, but I''m sure you''re waiting for anything.', '2004-06-14 23:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(763414, 81950, 2000, '<td valign="top">That branch in front of the owl''s feet make it appear that he''s floating/hanging... which is quite weird.  However, I like the idea, and once I saw the feet, I do like the shot.</td>', 'That branch in front of the owl''s feet make it appear that he''s floating/hanging... which is quite weird.  However, I like the idea, and once I saw the feet, I do like the shot.', '2004-06-14 23:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(763418, 82292, 2000, '<td valign="top">I was nicked on the last challenge I entered for cutting too close to a birds beak.... likewise, you have cut off the end of the subject''s shoe.  While this does not detract from the theme capture, I think this would be better executed without the guy''s foot cut off.</td>', 'I was nicked on the last challenge I entered for cutting too close to a birds beak.... likewise, you have cut off the end of the subject''s shoe.  While this does not detract from the theme capture, I think this would be better executed without the guy''s foot cut off.', '2004-06-14 23:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(763419, 82162, 2000, '<td valign="top">Bad pun, unique shot.  As the shot requires the title to make sense, I''m unsure that it truly captures the challenge theme.  The photo itself is well executed, with good contrast and detail.</td>', 'Bad pun, unique shot.  As the shot requires the title to make sense, I''m unsure that it truly captures the challenge theme.  The photo itself is well executed, with good contrast and detail.', '2004-06-14 23:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(763421, 82186, 2000, '<td valign="top">Nice color and silouhette capture here.</td>', 'Nice color and silouhette capture here.', '2004-06-14 23:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(763423, 82208, 2000, '<td valign="top">Waiting on a spider too?  Good shot, nice capture of the theme - however, the lack of a spider does detract a bit.</td>', 'Waiting on a spider too?  Good shot, nice capture of the theme - however, the lack of a spider does detract a bit.', '2004-06-14 23:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(763426, 81380, 2000, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field capture.  Excellent theme catch... I think that exemplifies the concept of waiting perfectly.  A 10, I think.</td>', 'Good depth of field capture.  Excellent theme catch... I think that exemplifies the concept of waiting perfectly.  A 10, I think.', '2004-06-15 00:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(763427, 82142, 2000, '<td valign="top">A bit orange and kind of dark.  It seems that may be what you were going for, given the glare on the underside of the subject''s arm - I''m just not sure that being this dark is right for the shot.</td>', 'A bit orange and kind of dark.  It seems that may be what you were going for, given the glare on the underside of the subject''s arm - I''m just not sure that being this dark is right for the shot.', '2004-06-15 00:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(763428, 82140, 2000, '<td valign="top">And it''s waiting for occupants.  Good concept.</td>', 'And it''s waiting for occupants.  Good concept.', '2004-06-15 00:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(763429, 80946, 11895, '<td valign="top">fits the spirit of the challenge very well</td>', 'fits the spirit of the challenge very well', '2004-06-15 00:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(763432, 82147, 11895, '<td valign="top">very nice pic but I wish it had a little more depth of field</td>', 'very nice pic but I wish it had a little more depth of field', '2004-06-15 00:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(763460, 81653, 772, '<td valign="top">hmmmm... this shot has a lot of character and ''down home'' feel to it... Camraderie... lets eat :) = 10</td>', 'hmmmm... this shot has a lot of character and ''down home'' feel to it... Camraderie... lets eat :) = 10', '2004-06-15 00:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(763488, 82145, 23055, '<td valign="top">I AM SATAN!!!!  GIVE ME SOME FOOD, BUSTER!!!</td>', 'I AM SATAN!!!!  GIVE ME SOME FOOD, BUSTER!!!', '2004-06-15 01:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(763496, 82247, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting, exposure, and composition. One of the most technically superb photos I''ve seen in this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice lighting, exposure, and composition. One of the most technically superb photos I''ve seen in this challenge.', '2004-06-15 02:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(763497, 82250, 16241, '<td valign="top">sere</td>', 'sere', '2004-06-15 02:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(763499, 82260, 22748, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! Great composition and use of the horizontal frame. I''m not always a fan of black and white but this is very nice. I really have to give this a ten, it is so much better than the other 100-odd photos I''ve rated in this challenge.</td>', 'Brilliant! Great composition and use of the horizontal frame. I''m not always a fan of black and white but this is very nice. I really have to give this a ten, it is so much better than the other 100-odd photos I''ve rated in this challenge.', '2004-06-15 02:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(763501, 82210, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. Did you use a flash with a slow shutter speed? It''s weird how the ball and glove leave a dark trail; must be because when not illumated by the flash, the sky is much brighter than they are.  I don''t get a sense of waiting, though, there is just so much action that I can''t pull my mind away from the movement.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. Did you use a flash with a slow shutter speed? It''s weird how the ball and glove leave a dark trail; must be because when not illumated by the flash, the sky is much brighter than they are.  I don''t get a sense of waiting, though, there is just so much action that I can''t pull my mind away from the movement.', '2004-06-15 02:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(763502, 81485, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cute shot! Well done.</td>', 'Cute shot! Well done.', '2004-06-15 02:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(763507, 81787, 22748, '<td valign="top">Creative! I like it. How much of the shot was set up? Did you make the chalk marks, and are those really sillouettes of prison bars, or something more accessible?</td>', 'Creative! I like it. How much of the shot was set up? Did you make the chalk marks, and are those really sillouettes of prison bars, or something more accessible?', '2004-06-15 02:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(763530, 81712, 23018, '<td valign="top">nice position well done</td>', 'nice position well done', '2004-06-15 03:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(763540, 82140, 20375, '<td valign="top">Overexposed. Lighting at upper left is burned out...too bright.</td>', 'Overexposed. Lighting at upper left is burned out...too bright.', '2004-06-15 03:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(763541, 82102, 20375, '<td valign="top">Feel free to pm me but I''m sorry........ I don''t get it.</td>', 'Feel free to pm me but I''m sorry........ I don''t get it.', '2004-06-15 03:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(763547, 81091, 6130, '<td valign="top">So nice and cute.</td>', 'So nice and cute.', '2004-06-15 03:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(763548, 82286, 6130, '<td valign="top">Great 10.</td>', 'Great 10.', '2004-06-15 03:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(763549, 81152, 22748, '<td valign="top">Fantabulous! I am really drawn to this image. The blue cast is interesting, perhaps created by setting the white balance waaaay off? Or maybe a photoshop effect. Either way, it''s interesting, though I''d love to see the photo with a "natural" candlelight exposure, just for fun. Nice job.</td>', 'Fantabulous! I am really drawn to this image. The blue cast is interesting, perhaps created by setting the white balance waaaay off? Or maybe a photoshop effect. Either way, it''s interesting, though I''d love to see the photo with a "natural" candlelight exposure, just for fun. Nice job.', '2004-06-15 03:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(763550, 81678, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool idea! A teensy bit too much flash (or direct sunlight?) on the children, but it''s still fine.</td>', 'Cool idea! A teensy bit too much flash (or direct sunlight?) on the children, but it''s still fine.', '2004-06-15 03:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(763568, 81479, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a sweet picture. This is my favorite for the challenge!</td>', 'What a sweet picture. This is my favorite for the challenge!', '2004-06-15 05:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(763569, 81607, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really nice picture - these little girls really portray waiting so well. They just look bored to tears!</td>', 'Really nice picture - these little girls really portray waiting so well. They just look bored to tears!', '2004-06-15 05:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(763570, 82257, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really nice picture for the challenge. Her reflection in the window makes it really unique. Great job!</td>', 'Really nice picture for the challenge. Her reflection in the window makes it really unique. Great job!', '2004-06-15 05:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(763571, 81543, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture really fits the challenge well. I think I''d like it better if it was in sharper focus.</td>', 'Your picture really fits the challenge well. I think I''d like it better if it was in sharper focus.', '2004-06-15 05:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(763574, 82392, 18552, '<td valign="top">This spider looks quite, quite dead - doubt it is waiting for anything.  The sepia is okay but the fading off of the edges detracts from the picture, to my eyes. The composition of your picture is very good.</td>', 'This spider looks quite, quite dead - doubt it is waiting for anything.  The sepia is okay but the fading off of the edges detracts from the picture, to my eyes. The composition of your picture is very good.', '2004-06-15 05:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(763575, 82380, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture has great colors and focus however, it really doesn''t convey waiting except for the title. Just looking at it conveys "wet" to me - not waiting.</td>', 'Your picture has great colors and focus however, it really doesn''t convey waiting except for the title. Just looking at it conveys "wet" to me - not waiting.', '2004-06-15 05:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(763576, 81760, 22759, '<td valign="top">I like these kind of pictures, that make you think of what you really see. Where did you took this picture?</td>', 'I like these kind of pictures, that make you think of what you really see. Where did you took this picture?', '2004-06-15 05:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(763580, 82484, 22759, '<td valign="top">It''s always nice too see a traffic jam, as long as you are not in it...</td>', 'It''s always nice too see a traffic jam, as long as you are not in it...', '2004-06-15 05:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(763582, 81948, 18552, '<td valign="top">Great action picture - the colors are lovely and the focus is great. However, it doesn''t really convey waiting to me at all - these people look like they are rushing towards something, not waiting for something.</td>', 'Great action picture - the colors are lovely and the focus is great. However, it doesn''t really convey waiting to me at all - these people look like they are rushing towards something, not waiting for something.', '2004-06-15 05:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(763583, 82362, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture does convey waiting but to my eye it is really, really dark. It doesn''t look like a real fisherman as he doesn''t have a real pole.</td>', 'Your picture does convey waiting but to my eye it is really, really dark. It doesn''t look like a real fisherman as he doesn''t have a real pole.', '2004-06-15 05:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
