(763594, 81972, 18552, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for the challenge. The colors are good and so it the composition. There seems to be a lot of pixelization on all the edges in the picture. Don''t know if it''s because you cropped this from a bigger pic or perhaps in resizing it got jaggy on all the edges.</td>', 'Nice idea for the challenge. The colors are good and so it the composition. There seems to be a lot of pixelization on all the edges in the picture. Don''t know if it''s because you cropped this from a bigger pic or perhaps in resizing it got jaggy on all the edges.', '2004-06-15 05:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
