(763597, 81786, 9809, '<td valign="top">The color is great, the lighting is great. The Analogous colors of green with a touch of yellow contrast well with the complimentary red. The black background really sets it off. I also like the way the bud .. um pedal/outer thingies (I''m not a botanist) open toward the camera. The DOF is great-- I can see detail from the closest to furthest parts of the object. Meets the challenge: Hmmm. While everything in nature is in a state of change, I don''t see "a sense of waiting" when looking at the photo. <br/></td>', 'The color is great, the lighting is great. The Analogous colors of green with a touch of yellow contrast well with the complimentary red. The black background really sets it off. I also like the way the bud .. um pedal/outer thingies (I''m not a botanist) open toward the camera. The DOF is great-- I can see detail from the closest to furthest parts of the object. Meets the challenge: Hmmm. While everything in nature is in a state of change, I don''t see "a sense of waiting" when looking at the photo. ', '2004-06-15 05:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(763598, 82206, 6172, '<td valign="top">good concept, and the photo is good technically.  Seems like the presentation could have been more creative.</td>', 'good concept, and the photo is good technically.  Seems like the presentation could have been more creative.', '2004-06-15 05:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(763599, 81085, 9809, '<td valign="top">A unique take on the challenge -- I haven''t seen anything like this (yet), but it fits the challenge so well. Nice choice of topic. The DOF works well with the near items on the left being slightly out of focus, but not enough that we cannot tell what it says and the "day before" and target dates are sharply in focus. The trailing numbers are too in focus to compliment the 2, 3, 4 and the tip of the pencil is out of focus. I wish you would have made your focus point just a touch closer, but maybe you tried that and it didn''t work out for some other reason. Anyway, nice execution overall.</td>', 'A unique take on the challenge -- I haven''t seen anything like this (yet), but it fits the challenge so well. Nice choice of topic. The DOF works well with the near items on the left being slightly out of focus, but not enough that we cannot tell what it says and the "day before" and target dates are sharply in focus. The trailing numbers are too in focus to compliment the 2, 3, 4 and the tip of the pencil is out of focus. I wish you would have made your focus point just a touch closer, but maybe you tried that and it didn''t work out for some other reason. Anyway, nice execution overall.', '2004-06-15 05:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(763600, 81559, 6172, '<td valign="top">good catch.</td>', 'good catch.', '2004-06-15 05:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
