(763739, 82207, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic sky. I like the whimsey of the stoplights. Levels are good. It looks like there are some artifacts along the bottom edge of the boom. The focus on the boom and stoplights could be a bit better. it looks like you''re far enough back to get enough DOF althoug it may have bees so dark you had to shoot wide open to get the sky. This is among my top picks this week. Hope it does well.</td>', 'Very dramatic sky. I like the whimsey of the stoplights. Levels are good. It looks like there are some artifacts along the bottom edge of the boom. The focus on the boom and stoplights could be a bit better. it looks like you''re far enough back to get enough DOF althoug it may have bees so dark you had to shoot wide open to get the sky. This is among my top picks this week. Hope it does well.', '2004-06-15 10:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
