(763741, 81152, 18197, '<td valign="top">Your choice of color perfectly conveys the mood of waiting. The disappointment and the anxiety. Lighting does a nice job of bringing out the reflections on the glass, the silverware, corkscrew and the plates. The candel flames and their reflections on the wall are little hot. I might suggest toning them down a bit. All in all, the best photo and it got my top score. Hope you ribbon.<br/> <br/>Oh, and by the way, if it were me I wouldn''t make her wait!</td>', 'Your choice of color perfectly conveys the mood of waiting. The disappointment and the anxiety. Lighting does a nice job of bringing out the reflections on the glass, the silverware, corkscrew and the plates. The candel flames and their reflections on the wall are little hot. I might suggest toning them down a bit. All in all, the best photo and it got my top score. Hope you ribbon. Oh, and by the way, if it were me I wouldn''t make her wait!', '2004-06-15 10:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
