(764135, 81769, 22738, '<td valign="top">Rating: 3/5 for concept (aka meeting the challenge), and 3/5 for technique, for a score of 6.  If you had rotated yourself to be to the left of the port-a-potty waiting line, perhaps you could have cut out some of the distracting left hand background?</td>', 'Rating: 3/5 for concept (aka meeting the challenge), and 3/5 for technique, for a score of 6.  If you had rotated yourself to be to the left of the port-a-potty waiting line, perhaps you could have cut out some of the distracting left hand background?', '2004-06-15 16:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(764139, 81559, 22738, '<td valign="top">He sure does seem to be waiting :)  4/5 for meeting the challenge, 3/5 for technique and composition.  Overall photo is a bit dark;  cropping seems a bit close side to side.</td>', 'He sure does seem to be waiting :)  4/5 for meeting the challenge, 3/5 for technique and composition.  Overall photo is a bit dark;  cropping seems a bit close side to side.', '2004-06-15 16:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(764141, 82262, 22738, '<td valign="top">3 out of 5 for meeting the challenge, 2 of 5 for the technique/composition.... while the  blur of the bus creates interest, the blur of the left hand human being is a bit distracting...</td>', '3 out of 5 for meeting the challenge, 2 of 5 for the technique/composition.... while the  blur of the bus creates interest, the blur of the left hand human being is a bit distracting...', '2004-06-15 16:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(764145, 82470, 22738, '<td valign="top">3.5/5 for meeting the challenge, 3.5/5 for technique.  I like this photo in black and white!</td>', '3.5/5 for meeting the challenge, 3.5/5 for technique.  I like this photo in black and white!', '2004-06-15 16:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(764146, 82193, 22738, '<td valign="top">1/5 for meeting the challenge, 2/5 for technique, composition - total score, 3..    The composition is quite nice, but the depth of field is so shallow that elements of the subject are blurred;  the overall contrast seems a bit too high, and the background a bit too dark.</td>', '1/5 for meeting the challenge, 2/5 for technique, composition - total score, 3..    The composition is quite nice, but the depth of field is so shallow that elements of the subject are blurred;  the overall contrast seems a bit too high, and the background a bit too dark.', '2004-06-15 16:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(764149, 82332, 22738, '<td valign="top">meeting the challenge 1/5, technique/composition: 4/5, for a total score of 5.  I rather like the silhouette effects, and the lens and solarflares are quite nice.  Unfortunately, without the caption, this one doesn''t scream ''waiting'' to me, although I understand it.</td>', 'meeting the challenge 1/5, technique/composition: 4/5, for a total score of 5.  I rather like the silhouette effects, and the lens and solarflares are quite nice.  Unfortunately, without the caption, this one doesn''t scream ''waiting'' to me, although I understand it.', '2004-06-15 16:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(764151, 81950, 22738, '<td valign="top">meeting the challenge: 1/5, composition/technique: 4/5, for a total score of 5.  I quite like this photograph;  however, it doesn''t give me a strong sense of waiting, and I wouldn''t have had any at all without the caption.</td>', 'meeting the challenge: 1/5, composition/technique: 4/5, for a total score of 5.  I quite like this photograph;  however, it doesn''t give me a strong sense of waiting, and I wouldn''t have had any at all without the caption.', '2004-06-15 16:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(764154, 82145, 22738, '<td valign="top">Meeting the challenge: 1/5, technique/composition: 5/5, for a total score of 6.  I quite like the photograph, which conveys ''hungry'' to me more than ''waiting'', which I can get from the caption, but not from the photograph on its own.  Great catch of a photo....</td>', 'Meeting the challenge: 1/5, technique/composition: 5/5, for a total score of 6.  I quite like the photograph, which conveys ''hungry'' to me more than ''waiting'', which I can get from the caption, but not from the photograph on its own.  Great catch of a photo....', '2004-06-15 16:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(764157, 82102, 22738, '<td valign="top">meeting the challenge: 0/5, technique/composition: 2/5, for a score of 2.  I don''t understand the concept for waiting.  The overall composition of the photograph isn''t bad, although I think the path would have looked a bit better if more to the left of the photograph.  The photo appears a bit under-exposured.</td>', 'meeting the challenge: 0/5, technique/composition: 2/5, for a score of 2.  I don''t understand the concept for waiting.  The overall composition of the photograph isn''t bad, although I think the path would have looked a bit better if more to the left of the photograph.  The photo appears a bit under-exposured.', '2004-06-15 16:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(764162, 82159, 22738, '<td valign="top">Meeting the challenge: 4/5,  technique/composition: 2.5/5, total score (rounded up): 7.  The caption doesn''t really add to this photo, but happily, I don''t judge that :)  If you draw a line down the center of the photo from top to bottom, I  *really* like the right half.  Too badd that the man on the left is blurred... the expression on the horse''s face really captures waiting...</td>', 'Meeting the challenge: 4/5,  technique/composition: 2.5/5, total score (rounded up): 7.  The caption doesn''t really add to this photo, but happily, I don''t judge that :)  If you draw a line down the center of the photo from top to bottom, I  *really* like the right half.  Too badd that the man on the left is blurred... the expression on the horse''s face really captures waiting...', '2004-06-15 16:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
