(764397, 81985, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely study. It actually looks very strong when cropped right and top (losing the ear and top of head to just above the window frame). It helps to make the eye focus on his expression rather than the distraction of the items in the background. Try looking at the areas that would be cropped out in isolation - they''re not very interesting or helpful to the composition.<br/> <br/>Great tones.</td>', 'This is a lovely study. It actually looks very strong when cropped right and top (losing the ear and top of head to just above the window frame). It helps to make the eye focus on his expression rather than the distraction of the items in the background. Try looking at the areas that would be cropped out in isolation - they''re not very interesting or helpful to the composition. Great tones.', '2004-06-15 20:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
