(764599, 82348, 20662, '<td valign="top">too funny -- what a look on the dogs face!</td>', 'too funny -- what a look on the dogs face!', '2004-06-15 22:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(764601, 82416, 20662, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this better if you''d cropped in closer to the women on the bnech. The bold blue sign distracts from her.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this better if you''d cropped in closer to the women on the bnech. The bold blue sign distracts from her.', '2004-06-15 22:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(764602, 82205, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the use of light tan, and then body tan. great composition- the title is such an enigma. waiting in vain for what ... add your lewd comment here...I''ll spare you mine. nice shot</td>', 'I like the use of light tan, and then body tan. great composition- the title is such an enigma. waiting in vain for what ... add your lewd comment here...I''ll spare you mine. nice shot', '2004-06-15 22:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(764603, 82455, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice ... great greens and textures, but a bit not as pleasing a it could be if you saw the darn b-fly. and the dead center aspect is disturbing- it pulls your eyes to the leaf.</td>', 'Nice ... great greens and textures, but a bit not as pleasing a it could be if you saw the darn b-fly. and the dead center aspect is disturbing- it pulls your eyes to the leaf.', '2004-06-15 22:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(764604, 82347, 1368, '<td valign="top">What a cute little baby :)  I think it would have been better if you would have cropped the background out, it is a little distracting.  Good luck to you :)</td>', 'What a cute little baby :)  I think it would have been better if you would have cropped the background out, it is a little distracting.  Good luck to you :)', '2004-06-15 22:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(764606, 82141, 12611, '<td valign="top">great portrait. the only criticism may be that the expression is so great I''d rather see this shot in the sunlight.</td>', 'great portrait. the only criticism may be that the expression is so great I''d rather see this shot in the sunlight.', '2004-06-15 22:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(764608, 82044, 1368, '<td valign="top">I want you! Oh my this is so wonderful, looks like my cat, she also has a little black spot on her head :) wonderful moody  picture gives me a sad feeling, good luck :)</td>', 'I want you! Oh my this is so wonderful, looks like my cat, she also has a little black spot on her head :) wonderful moody  picture gives me a sad feeling, good luck :)', '2004-06-15 22:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(764610, 82070, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the urban candid nature of this shot- I would like to see this shot 10 feet to the right and without the pole. I think thats the key. And although this lady is waiting- its too literal. She is not waiting in the true sense- in the frustrated where the hell is my bus sense- but in the I don;t care when the subway or bus or taxi show up, I have my paper I''m happy sense. Sorry so longwinded, just my opinion</td>', 'I love the urban candid nature of this shot- I would like to see this shot 10 feet to the right and without the pole. I think thats the key. And although this lady is waiting- its too literal. She is not waiting in the true sense- in the frustrated where the hell is my bus sense- but in the I don;t care when the subway or bus or taxi show up, I have my paper I''m happy sense. Sorry so longwinded, just my opinion', '2004-06-15 22:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(764611, 81737, 1368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, so pieceful  Great colors too :)</td>', 'Beautiful shot, so pieceful  Great colors too :)', '2004-06-15 22:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(764612, 82204, 12611, '<td valign="top">The title is a bit stetchy-but the composition and colors are Nice. I love the pipe that runs thru the shot. THis is unique because despite the child pictured prominently in the photo, it still does not appear to be a "portrait" at all...</td>', 'The title is a bit stetchy-but the composition and colors are Nice. I love the pipe that runs thru the shot. THis is unique because despite the child pictured prominently in the photo, it still does not appear to be a "portrait" at all...', '2004-06-15 22:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(764615, 82044, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nobody wants you- you''ll scratch my furniture and pee on my rug. <br/>stop puppy mills(and animal shots). But seriously. I love the compostion and this whole shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-17 16:34:31.</i></td>', 'Nobody wants you- you''ll scratch my furniture and pee on my rug. stop puppy mills(and animal shots). But seriously. I love the compostion and this whole shot.', '2004-06-15 22:55:38.000000', '2004-06-17 17:34:31.000000', 1),
(764616, 82160, 7560, '<td valign="top">I saw this shot after watching an episode of Family Plots. :)  Great choice of black and white. I''d like to see more of the hourglass.  It''s kind of blending into the lid. This shot has some great stock potential. 7</td>', 'I saw this shot after watching an episode of Family Plots. :)  Great choice of black and white. I''d like to see more of the hourglass.  It''s kind of blending into the lid. This shot has some great stock potential. 7', '2004-06-15 22:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(764618, 82314, 12611, '<td valign="top">A bit oversaturated- and the funny thing is- the  mountain still looks devoid of color.I like teh classic "build the new bridge adn leave up the old" mentality going on here.</td>', 'A bit oversaturated- and the funny thing is- the  mountain still looks devoid of color.I like teh classic "build the new bridge adn leave up the old" mentality going on here.', '2004-06-15 22:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
