(764640, 81987, 12611, '<td valign="top">any futile attempt to meet the challenge aside... I really like this shot<br/>great lighting, focus and composition. No go take pictures of something more photogenic.</td>', 'any futile attempt to meet the challenge aside... I really like this shotgreat lighting, focus and composition. No go take pictures of something more photogenic.', '2004-06-15 23:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(764643, 82285, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the chair and the look is fantastic- but the the blinds and the glare behind in fantastic.  much like mona lisa was hard to read, the pregnant brunette looks angry- but for teh simple fact that it is an unspoken rule never to film the gravida female in profile... oh yeah, congratulations.</td>', 'I like the chair and the look is fantastic- but the the blinds and the glare behind in fantastic.  much like mona lisa was hard to read, the pregnant brunette looks angry- but for teh simple fact that it is an unspoken rule never to film the gravida female in profile... oh yeah, congratulations.', '2004-06-15 23:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(764645, 82392, 12611, '<td valign="top">all in all quite nice- but I don''t like <br/>1. the size and shape of the picture<br/>2. the oversharpened grainy slippery nature of the foor on the right.<br/>wonderful lighting and feathering technique on the edges</td>', 'all in all quite nice- but I don''t like 1. the size and shape of the picture2. the oversharpened grainy slippery nature of the foor on the right.wonderful lighting and feathering technique on the edges', '2004-06-15 23:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(764655, 82330, 20771, '<td valign="top">Really conveys the anticipation of waiting.  I particularly like the way the cheek and the shadow recapitulate the expanded balloon and the way the bricks show through the balloon,and in the balloon''s shadow.</td>', 'Really conveys the anticipation of waiting.  I particularly like the way the cheek and the shadow recapitulate the expanded balloon and the way the bricks show through the balloon,and in the balloon''s shadow.', '2004-06-15 23:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(764657, 82369, 12611, '<td valign="top">the trees are distracting. there is nice sublime feeling though.<br/>I would suggest rethinking the shot to add afocal point or include a touch of ground/land in the shot. imho</td>', 'the trees are distracting. there is nice sublime feeling though.I would suggest rethinking the shot to add afocal point or include a touch of ground/land in the shot. imho', '2004-06-15 23:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(764660, 81726, 20771, '<td valign="top">Terrific subject, color, lighting and focus. The tight focus on the golden eyes makes the picture.</td>', 'Terrific subject, color, lighting and focus. The tight focus on the golden eyes makes the picture.', '2004-06-15 23:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(764661, 82348, 12611, '<td valign="top">good dog!nice strong vertical composition, nice focus and sharpness there is a bit of an overexposed feeling though.</td>', 'good dog!nice strong vertical composition, nice focus and sharpness there is a bit of an overexposed feeling though.', '2004-06-15 23:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(764666, 81685, 12611, '<td valign="top">nice going but its a bit distracting all the out of focusness. I would suggest focusing on the glass and blurring the foreground.</td>', 'nice going but its a bit distracting all the out of focusness. I would suggest focusing on the glass and blurring the foreground.', '2004-06-15 23:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(764674, 81265, 12611, '<td valign="top">so deep... so long and lean... so empire waisted...so overdressed. and what does she have in her hand? a purse, a gun.  a phone, a clump of dress? it is up to the viewer to decide and finish the story.</td>', 'so deep... so long and lean... so empire waisted...so overdressed. and what does she have in her hand? a purse, a gun.  a phone, a clump of dress? it is up to the viewer to decide and finish the story.', '2004-06-15 23:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(764676, 82346, 20771, '<td valign="top">Very nicely seen picture. II particularly like the rhythm of the composition, with the bus coming in clockwise to the stop and the  platform and passengers arcing in the counterclockwise direction. The color and reflections in the wet streets also work well.</td>', 'Very nicely seen picture. II particularly like the rhythm of the composition, with the bus coming in clockwise to the stop and the  platform and passengers arcing in the counterclockwise direction. The color and reflections in the wet streets also work well.', '2004-06-15 23:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(764678, 82292, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the angst and pain on the face of the protagonist. THe guy walking in the back is distracting</td>', 'I like the angst and pain on the face of the protagonist. THe guy walking in the back is distracting', '2004-06-15 23:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
