(764693, 82067, 20771, '<td valign="top">I''m not convinced that he is waiting for a worm, but it is a beautiful, well-composed picture of a brightly colored bird and good enough for my vote of an 8</td>', 'I''m not convinced that he is waiting for a worm, but it is a beautiful, well-composed picture of a brightly colored bird and good enough for my vote of an 8', '2004-06-15 23:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(764694, 82191, 11738, '<td valign="top">Wainting?  Is that a combination of waiting and wanting?  LOL!  Gotta watch those typos.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Wainting?  Is that a combination of waiting and wanting?  LOL!  Gotta watch those typos.  Nice shot.', '2004-06-15 23:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(764697, 82067, 20809, '<td valign="top">Awsome colors... nice 7</td>', 'Awsome colors... nice 7', '2004-06-15 23:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(764707, 81354, 20771, '<td valign="top">This simple composition strongly evokes the observer, the person waiting for something to happen. I imagine that the colored image probably doesn''t work  as well as the monochromatic image. I really like the mysterious quality of this picture.</td>', 'This simple composition strongly evokes the observer, the person waiting for something to happen. I imagine that the colored image probably doesn''t work  as well as the monochromatic image. I really like the mysterious quality of this picture.', '2004-06-15 23:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(764716, 82380, 20771, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast between the fluidity of the droplets and  reflctions and the relative rigidity of the wood grain. Perfect exposure and color.  A nice abstraction, which I scored high, despite the lack of evidence to convince me that the drops are truly waiting for the sun. Creativity in titling can bve important.</td>', 'I really like the contrast between the fluidity of the droplets and  reflctions and the relative rigidity of the wood grain. Perfect exposure and color.  A nice abstraction, which I scored high, despite the lack of evidence to convince me that the drops are truly waiting for the sun. Creativity in titling can bve important.', '2004-06-15 23:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(764724, 82205, 11738, '<td valign="top">This shot could have done with less girl and more surroundings.  Angle of shot isn''t too flattering either.  Good sepia toning.</td>', 'This shot could have done with less girl and more surroundings.  Angle of shot isn''t too flattering either.  Good sepia toning.', '2004-06-15 23:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
