(764795, 81764, 9668, '<td valign="top">Great image! I know how hard it is to #1 get the cat to stick it''s tongue out, and #2 time it with such a capture as this. Cats normally aren''t like on DPChallnege, but this is well done. I would like the lighting to be more even, focus would be better on the eyes instead of the nose.</td>', 'Great image! I know how hard it is to #1 get the cat to stick it''s tongue out, and #2 time it with such a capture as this. Cats normally aren''t like on DPChallnege, but this is well done. I would like the lighting to be more even, focus would be better on the eyes instead of the nose.', '2004-06-16 00:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(764798, 82142, 9668, '<td valign="top">Too bad the hand is so noisy, but I like the slow exposure on it. Cool idea, lighting seems unnatural.</td>', 'Too bad the hand is so noisy, but I like the slow exposure on it. Cool idea, lighting seems unnatural.', '2004-06-16 00:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
