(765274, 81737, 9913, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by TabbyCat:</b></div><hr/><i> Eek! Okay, so I was totally wrong about guessing you to be Nazgul... ;-) But take it as a compliment, as he creates terrific photographs and this photograph is a terrific one also! Congratulations! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Maybe you guessed it was me because its verty similar to my Centered submission... but I never do the same idea more than once...<br/> <br/>This one I have to say that is much better than mine ..</td>', 'Originally posted by TabbyCat: Eek! Okay, so I was totally wrong about guessing you to be Nazgul... ;-) But take it as a compliment, as he creates terrific photographs and this photograph is a terrific one also! Congratulations!   Maybe you guessed it was me because its verty similar to my Centered submission... but I never do the same idea more than once... This one I have to say that is much better than mine ..', '2004-06-16 04:51:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(765292, 81380, 9668, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this annoys me that you would do this well. I guess it''s a bit rude, but I had the same oppurtunities (taking pictures at a high school graduation ceremony) and my picture got 210th, and this one got 19th. I''m not complaining about my placement, or at least not trying too, but maybe posting my dissapointment on not getting a better shot.<br/>Good job though, great capture of the moment.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this annoys me that you would do this well. I guess it''s a bit rude, but I had the same oppurtunities (taking pictures at a high school graduation ceremony) and my picture got 210th, and this one got 19th. I''m not complaining about my placement, or at least not trying too, but maybe posting my dissapointment on not getting a better shot.Good job though, great capture of the moment.', '2004-06-16 05:18:30.000000', NULL, 0),
