(765361, 82362, 11738, '<td valign="top">I knew it.  They ARE both from the same place.  Congrats to both of you for finding such a cool spot and shooting it so well.  Félicitations pour to premier ruban Lili.  Beau travail :)</td>', 'I knew it.  They ARE both from the same place.  Congrats to both of you for finding such a cool spot and shooting it so well.  Félicitations pour to premier ruban Lili.  Beau travail :)', '2004-06-16 06:45:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(765364, 81737, 11738, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture and congrats for the ribbon.  Good job on inverting the image right to left to fool most of us into thinking that it was taken at two seperate locations.  Like I told Lili, you found a great spot to shoot and executed your shots very well.  Félicitations pour une autre belle job.</td>', 'Very nice capture and congrats for the ribbon.  Good job on inverting the image right to left to fool most of us into thinking that it was taken at two seperate locations.  Like I told Lili, you found a great spot to shoot and executed your shots very well.  Félicitations pour une autre belle job.', '2004-06-16 06:50:20.000000', NULL, 0),
