(765628, 81380, 11815, '<td valign="top">Zoomdak, take a look at your photo then look at this one again.  They are completely different animals.  You photographed chairs.  The empty chairs in conjunction with the title make it work for the challenge, but in itself it isnt a particularly good picture.  Please do not take this as an attack.  Perhaps what  you should be observing is that virtually the same shot got a blue and gold ribbon.  This doesnt say anything about the photographer, other than they know each other.  It says a great deal about how people rate and what people on this site like.  Look at the placements.  4th and 5th are virtually identical.  Looking out the window was completely overdone for this challenge. 6th place, a very nice shot in comparison.  7th place, how did this place so high? Its not a bad idea but is it a good shot?  8th place is a lovely portrait, but waiting? The only thing that makes this image about waiting is the title. 9th and 10th are pregnant women, what a surprise. They fit the challenge but are they good?  There were some great images in this challenge and they placed so low.  Granted the same can be said about my photo, I have no pretenses about my photo meeting the challenge perfectly. But its different from the rest. It is technically different and the image is completely different from any other posted.  So thats a good thing.  Congrats to the winners.  The blue ribbon winner has a truly beautiful image and deserved to win.  What are ratings based on here?  Is it technique and image? Pretty colors? How close the image matches the challenge?  What?</td>', 'Zoomdak, take a look at your photo then look at this one again.  They are completely different animals.  You photographed chairs.  The empty chairs in conjunction with the title make it work for the challenge, but in itself it isnt a particularly good picture.  Please do not take this as an attack.  Perhaps what  you should be observing is that virtually the same shot got a blue and gold ribbon.  This doesnt say anything about the photographer, other than they know each other.  It says a great deal about how people rate and what people on this site like.  Look at the placements.  4th and 5th are virtually identical.  Looking out the window was completely overdone for this challenge. 6th place, a very nice shot in comparison.  7th place, how did this place so high? Its not a bad idea but is it a good shot?  8th place is a lovely portrait, but waiting? The only thing that makes this image about waiting is the title. 9th and 10th are pregnant women, what a surprise. They fit the challenge but are they good?  There were some great images in this challenge and they placed so low.  Granted the same can be said about my photo, I have no pretenses about my photo meeting the challenge perfectly. But its different from the rest. It is technically different and the image is completely different from any other posted.  So thats a good thing.  Congrats to the winners.  The blue ribbon winner has a truly beautiful image and deserved to win.  What are ratings based on here?  Is it technique and image? Pretty colors? How close the image matches the challenge?  What?', '2004-06-16 10:32:35.000000', NULL, 0),
