(767401, 82362, 16862, '<td valign="top">This picture is simply perfect. I could come up with suggestions of how I would have taken it, maybe it should have been this way or that way. But I´m not going to do that cause I think that you made the beautiful scenery tell a story in a perfect way, and I just don´t have anything to add to it. It´s not enough to find a place like this and take a picture, you have to make something of it, and you did. <br/> <br/>Congratulations for the 1st place, you deserve it</td>', 'This picture is simply perfect. I could come up with suggestions of how I would have taken it, maybe it should have been this way or that way. But I´m not going to do that cause I think that you made the beautiful scenery tell a story in a perfect way, and I just don´t have anything to add to it. It´s not enough to find a place like this and take a picture, you have to make something of it, and you did.  Congratulations for the 1st place, you deserve it', '2004-06-17 10:34:11.000000', NULL, 0),
