(767483, 82260, 15920, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by librodo:</b></div><hr/><i> ....I am very happy for Katrina, too, my model.  My "Strength" entry here:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=69231" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/207/thumb/69231.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/207/thumb/69231.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/207/thumb/69231.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>also placed in the top 10 and was a subject of discussion.  She said that she is a jinx to me. Well, I don''t think so. I couldn''t have a more effective model than her.<br/>...</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ask her if she''ll pose for me?  I could use a little of that Jinx,<br/> <br/>Taking your camera to Mass and submitting whatever came up for shots?  You need to be recieving BLUEs for this to be just.  Nicely done (again!)</td>', 'Originally posted by librodo: ....I am very happy for Katrina, too, my model.  My "Strength" entry here:   also placed in the top 10 and was a subject of discussion.  She said that she is a jinx to me. Well, I don''t think so. I couldn''t have a more effective model than her....  Ask her if she''ll pose for me?  I could use a little of that Jinx, Taking your camera to Mass and submitting whatever came up for shots?  You need to be recieving BLUEs for this to be just.  Nicely done (again!)', '2004-06-17 12:01:13.000000', NULL, 0),
