(767992, 82260, 11181, '<td valign="top">WTG Manny!! Another ribbon! Congrats! Well deserved, well deserved :)<br/> <br/>Jose<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-17 20:08:15.</i></td>', 'WTG Manny!! Another ribbon! Congrats! Well deserved, well deserved :) Jose', '2004-06-17 21:01:17.000000', '2004-06-17 21:08:15.000000', 0),
(768053, 81731, 13333, '<td valign="top">Opps, I did miss spell that didn''t I... Oh well I am a photographer not a writer :-)<br/> <br/>This is a macro shot, and as such there is very little DOF to work with.  This was also a very little spider.  For me I think that the legs going out of focus on the ends, makes this spider look and feel bigger then it really was.  It has a sence of power...  Looking back now it doesn''t have as much a sence of waiting as I orginaly thought, but I still love this shot.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cghubbell:</b></div><hr/><i> I think you might have misspelled your title.  With a shot like this, I have difficulty with the legs being so out of focus.  It really needs more depth of field to work. </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-17 20:55:54.</i></td>', 'Opps, I did miss spell that didn''t I... Oh well I am a photographer not a writer :-) This is a macro shot, and as such there is very little DOF to work with.  This was also a very little spider.  For me I think that the legs going out of focus on the ends, makes this spider look and feel bigger then it really was.  It has a sence of power...  Looking back now it doesn''t have as much a sence of waiting as I orginaly thought, but I still love this shot. Originally posted by cghubbell: I think you might have misspelled your title.  With a shot like this, I have difficulty with the legs being so out of focus.  It really needs more depth of field to work. ', '2004-06-17 21:50:53.000000', '2004-06-17 21:55:54.000000', 0),
(768060, 81731, 13333, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BobsterLobster:</b></div><hr/><i> Superb picture, but doesn''t give me a feeling of waiting. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Maybe I should have called it "If I build it, they will come"</td>', 'Originally posted by BobsterLobster: Superb picture, but doesn''t give me a feeling of waiting.   Maybe I should have called it "If I build it, they will come"', '2004-06-17 21:57:16.000000', NULL, 0),
